<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">2 Chronicle</book>
  <para style="h">2 Chronicle</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Chronicle</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Chronicle</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Chronicle</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Davida fapa Solomona chuan Israel ram chu a chang nghet ta hle a. Lalpa , a Pathian chuan mal a sâwm a, a lo chak ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi sâng hotu te, za hotu te, sawrkâr hnathawk te, hnam tin hruaitu te, Israel chhûng tin lu leh Israel-ho te chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gibeon khuaa kal vek tûrin a hrilh a; chutah chuan Lalpa nêna Inbiakna Bûk, Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosian thlalêra a siam kha a la awm ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm erawh chu Davida khân Kiriat-jearim aṭangin a la a, Jerusalem khuaa puan in a kaihsakah khân a dah a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Uria fapa, Bezalela, Hura tupa siam dâr maichâm pawh kha Gibeon-ah hian Biakbûk kawtah a la awm a ni. Bûk kawtah chuan Solomona leh mipuite chuan Lalpa chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal chuan Lalpa hnênah hâlral thilhlanah ran sângkhat a hlân a, bûk kawta dâr maichâmah a hâl ral a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Solomona hnênah Pathian a inlâr a, “Eng nge pe che ila i duh?” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Solomona chuan a chhâng a, “Ka pa Davida chu i ngaina êm êm ṭhîn a; tûnah, a ai awhah min dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, ka pa hnêna i thutiam kha tihlawhtling teh. Leia vaivut zât ngawta tam chungah lalah min siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />chuvângin, an chunga ro ka rêl thiamna tûrin finna leh hmangchâng hriatna min pe ang che. Chutilo chu, engtin nge i mi heti zozai hi ro ka rêlsak theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian chuan Solomona chu a chhâng a, “Hausakna te, neihnunna te, hmingthanna te, i hmêlma tihhlumsak te, dam reina te dîl lovin an chunga lala ka siamna che ka mite chunga ro i rêlsak thiam nân finna leh hmangchâng hriatna dîl nachâng i hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Finna leh hmangchâng hriatna chu ka pe ngei ang che; i hmaa lo lal tawhte pawhin an neih phâk loh hausakna te, neihnunna te leh hmingthanna te pawh ka pêk belh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomona chuan Gibeon khuaa hmunsâng, Lalpa nêna Inbiakna Bûk awmna chu a chhuahsan a, Jerusalem-ah a hâwng a, Israel-te chungah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sakawr-tawlailîr sângkhat leh zali leh indo sakawr sîngkhat leh sânghnih a nei a, a ṭhen chu Jerusalem-ah a kawl a, khawpui hrang hrangah a dang chu a dah darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lal chhûng hian Jerusalem-ah chuan rangkachak leh tangkarua chu lungte tlukin a tam a, sidar thing pawh khawthlang lam tlâng ṭhuta theipui kûng zât zetin a tam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomona sakawrte chu Aigupta leh Kilikia aṭanga tawlh khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal aiawha sumdâwngte chuan sakawr-tawlailîr tangka zaruk zêlin an lei a, sakawr pawh tangka za leh sawmngain an lei khâwm a; Hit mite leh Suria mite hnênah an hralh chhâwng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Lalpa an biakna tûr Tempul leh ama awmna tûr lal in sak a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil thiar khâwm tûrin mi sîngsarih a chhawr a, lung la tûrin mi sîngriat a chhawr bawk a. Hnathawkho vêngtu tûr mi sângthum leh zaruk a ruat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomona chuan Tura lal Hirama hnênah palai a tîr a, “Ka pa Davida tân sidar thing i tawlhsak ang khân kei pawh min tawlhsak teh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Pathian chawimawi nân Tempul ka sa dâwn a, kei leh ka mite tân hmun serh a ni ang a, chutah chuan rimtuite hâlin kan Pathian chu kan be ṭhîn dâwn a ni; chhang serhte pawh kan dah reng ang a, zîng leh tlaiah te, sabat ni-ah te, thla thar kûtah te leh kût ni dangah te hâlral thilhlan, Lalpa kan Pathian hnêna kan hlanna tûr ka sa dâwn a ni; chutianga amah chawimawi tûrin Israel-te chu kan Pathian hian thu a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempul ropui tak sak ka tum a, kan Pathian hi pathian dang zawng aiin a ropui si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dik tak chuan Pathian tân tu man in han sak rual a ni lo va, vânah pawh khian a leng lo a ni si a; Pathian tâna rimtui hâlna hmun tih mai loh chu kei tehlul hi a in han sa rual ka ni hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thil ker thiam, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr leh thîr chher thiam te, la dumpâwl te, la senduk te leh la senlâr te siam thiam han tîr la, ka pa Davida khân Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a mi themthiam a lo thlan chhuahte nên khân hna an thawk ho dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi themthiam tak tak i ngah hle tih ka hria a ni, Lebanon tlânga sidar thing te, far thing te, algum thing te min han thawn bawk ang che. I mite pui tûrin mi pawh ka rawn tîr mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tempul sak ka tum hi a lianin a ropui dâwn êm a, thingzai kan mamawh ṭeuh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I mi chhawrte tân huit fai ṭin nuaili, barli ṭin nuaili, uain ṭin sîngli, oliv hriak ṭin sîngli ka rawn tum ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal Hirama chuan Solomona chu lehkha a thawn a, “ Lalpa chuan a mite a hmangaih avângin an lalah a siam che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa , lei leh vân siamtu chu fakin awm rawh se. Lal Davida chu fapa fing tak leh remhre tak a pe a, ani chuan Lalpa Tempul leh ama awmna tûr in sak a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi fing, kut themthiam tak, Hurama ka rawn tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nu chu Dana thlah a ni a, a pa erawh chu Tura khaw mi hlun a ni. Rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr te, lung te, thing te a dek thiam êm êm a; la zai sîn vâr te, dumpâwl te, senduk leh senlâr te pawh a dek thiam êm êm a ni. Thil ker mawite a thiam a, sawi ang apiang a thiam zêl a ni. I mistiri themthiam rualte leh i pa Davida mi rawihte nên thawk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huit te, barli te, uain te leh oliv hriak pêk i tiam chu han thawn ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng aṭangin i duh zât zât sidar thing kan kit ang a, kan ṭâwn khâwm ang a, Jopa thlengin tuifinriatah kan rawn tawlh ang. Chuta ṭang chuan nangin Jerusalem-ah i la chho dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan a pa tih ang khân Israel rama hnam dang awm zawng zawng a chhiar a, in leh lo nei mi nuaikhat leh sîngnga leh sângthum zaruk an lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi sîngsarih chu thil a thiartîr a, mi sîngriat chuan tlânga lung an la a, hnathawk viltu tûr mi sângthum leh zaruk a dah bawk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona pa, Lal Davida khân, Jerusalem khaw chhûng Moria tlânga Jebus mi Ornana hruihzâwlah Tempul sakna tûr hmun a lo buatsaih diam tawh a, chutah chuan Solomonan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a lal kum lina thla hnihnaah Tempul chu a sa ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomonan Pathian tâna Tempul a rel chu a dung tawng sawmruk, a vang tawng sawmhnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pindan hmasa chu tawng sawmhnih bial a ni; a chung chu tawng za leh sawmhniha sâng a ni, a chhûng lam chu rangkachaka chei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pindan laita chu Sidar thinga thuah vek a ni; tûm thing leh khaidiat lem, rangkachak ṭha chia siam a bel chhuak vek a, chutah chuan tûm thing leh khaidiat lem a chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal chuan lungmantam mawi tak tak leh Parvaim ram rangkachakin Tempul chu a chei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A bang te, a khanchhuk te, a pindan hmasa leh a kawngkhâr te chu rangkachakin a luan a, bangahte chuan themthiamho chuan Cherub lemte an ker bawk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pindan chhûngril, Hmun Thianghlim Ber an tih chu tawng sawmhnih bial a ni, Tempul vâng lam tiat a nih chu. He Hmun Thianghlim Ber bang thuah nân hian rangkachak kg. sânghnih an hmang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />rangkachak thîrkilhna zanga leh sawmsarih an hmang a, pindan chhûng lam pawh rangkachaka tuam chhuah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalin themthiamho chu dârin Cherub pahnih lem a siamtîr a, rangkachakin an tuam a, Hmun Thianghlim Berah chuan a dahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pindan luhna lam hnungchhawnin a dahtîr a, thla pahnih an nei a, pakhat thla zâr chu tawng sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pakhat dang thla zâr pawh chu tawng sâwm a ni a, an thla hmawr chu a inkhawih a, a hmawr lehlam chuan bang a khawih ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Cherub thla zâr chu tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a luhna lam hnungchhawnin an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim Ber luhna puanzâr chu puan zai sîn a ni a, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te leh a senlâr tea tah a ni; Cherub lem an zep thluah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal chuan dâr ban mûm pahnih, tawng sawmthum leh pangaa sâng, hma lamah a phun a, a ban lu bâwk chu tawng nga hawlh tlanga lian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ban lu bâwk chu khaidiat anga chei kual a ni, khaidiat lem chhûngah chuan theibuhfai lem a chuang a, a vaiin za a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bante chu Tempul luhna bula phun a ni a, chhim lama ban chu Jakina ban an ti a, hmâr lama mi chu Boaza ban an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona chuan dâr maichâm tawng sawmhnih bial, tawng sâwma sâng a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuizêm, teh kuala tawng sawmthum, tawng sâwm hawlh tlang, tawng ngaa sâng, dârin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuizêm bang pâwn lam chu tlar hnihin an cheimawi a, an cheina chu bâwngchal lem a ni a, zêm chhûn ruala chhûn tel nghâl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuizêm chu bâwngchal lem sâwm leh pahnih chungah a innghat a, pathumin chhim lam an hawi a, chutiang pathum zêl chuan hmâr lam te, chhak lam te, thlang lam te an hawi a, an hnung lam chu a insi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuizêm bang chu kutphah bawka chhah a ni, a tlâng chu no tlâng arh, lilipâr ang hian a arh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dâr chawhtawlh sâwm a siam bawk a, panga chu Tempul hmâr lama dah tûr a ni, panga dang chu chhim lamah; an kût nia thilhlan sil faina tûr tui dah nân a ni; dâr tuizêma tui chu puithiamho insilna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A siam dân pangngaia siam khâwnvâr dahna sâwm rangkachakin a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a hûnna tûr dawhkân sâwm a siam bawk a. Pindan laitaah khân a dah a, a sîr tuakah panga ve vein a hûng a, rangkachak chawhtawlh za a siam bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puithiamho awmna tûr pindan te leh tualzâwl te a siam a. Pindan kawngkhârte a siam a, dârin a tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuizêm chu Tempul chhimchhak kilah an hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hurama chuan bêl te, vutlawh te, chawhtawlh te a siam a. Pathian Tempula hman tûr ṭûl zawng zawng chu Solomona a siamsak ta a. Hêng hi a thil siamte chu a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dâr ban pahnih, ban lu bâwk nei, no bial anga kûm, khaidiat lem a kuala tlar hniha awm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ban lu bâwkah chuan theibuhfai lem zali, khaidiat kual chhûng zêlah tlar hnih a awm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chawhtawlh sâwm leh a nawrsawnna tawlailîr sâwm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuizêm lian, a hûnna bâwngchal lem sâwm leh pahnih nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />bêl te, vutlawh te, dâr thîrkut te a siam a ni. Chûng thil chu Huraman dârin Lalpa ina hman atân Solomona chu a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sukot leh Zereda inkâr, Jordan lui phaizâwl bellei khurah chûng chu lal chuan themthiamho chu a chhûntîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hêng bungbêl hi a tam êm a, a bûk zât hriat sên a ni lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Solomona chuan Pathian Tempul chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng chu a siam a, rangkachak maichâm, chhang serh dahna tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlima chhit reng tûrin khâwnvâr leh a dahnate rangkachak hlîr hlakin a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />pangpâr lem te, chaicheh te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />khâwnvâr huh hlumna te, rimtui hâlna berhbu te, meilawh te, rangkachak vekin a siam a. Tempul luhna kawngkhâr leh Hmun Thianghlim Ber luhna kawngkhâr pawh chu rangkachakin a siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Tempul hna zawng zawng chu Solomona chuan a thawk zo ta a. A pa Davidan thil a lo serh hran tawh, tangkarua te, rangkachak te leh bungbêl te chu Solomona chuan Tempul sum dahnaah chuan a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomona chuan Israel upa te, hnam hruaitu te, chhûng tin puipa te chu Davida khawpui Zion aṭanga Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm laa, Tempul chhûnga dah tûrin a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thla sarihna, Bâwkte kûtah chuan, Israel mi zawng zawng chu an lo kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel upate an lo thlen chuan Levia chite chuan Thuthlung Bâwm chu an zâwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempul an zâwn thleng a, Puithiamte leh Levia chite chuan Biakbûk leh a hmanrua zawng zawng chu tempul-ah an la lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chu lal Solomona hovin Thuthlung Bâwm hmaah chuan an lo kal khâwm a, berâm leh bâwng chhiar sên loh thilhlanah an talh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puithiamho chuan Thuthlung Bâwm chu Tempul chhûngah an zâwn lût a, Hmun Thianghlim Bera Cherub thla zâr hnuaiah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An thla zâr chuan bâwm leh a zâwnna chu a khuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zâwnfung hmâwr chu Hmun Thianghlim Ber kawngka zâwn taka din chuan a lang thei, hmun dang aṭang chuan a lang thei lo. A zâwnfung chu tûn thlengin a la invuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bâwm chhûngah chuan eng mah dang a awm lo, Aigupta ram aṭanga an lo chhuah laia Lalpa thuthlung, Horeb tlânga ziakna lungphêk pahnih Mosia dah chauh kha a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eng pâwla tel ṭhîn pawh ni se puithiamho chu an inthian thianghlim sa vek a. Hmun Thianghlim Ber aṭang chuan an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levia chi, zaipâwla tel - Asafa te, Kenana te, Jeduthuna te chu an hote nên puan zai sîn vâr silhfên inbelin dârbenthek te, ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te an rawn keng a, maichâm bul khawchhak lamah an ding a, tawtawrâwt tum tûr puithiam za leh sawmhnih an tel bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt pute leh zaipâwlte chu Lalpa fakna hla saa, a hnêna lâwmthu sawina hla sa tûr an ni. Tawtawrâwt te, dârbenthek te leh thil ri thei dangte nên zaipâwl chuan Lalpa fakna hla, ‘ Lalpa chu fak rawh u, a ṭha si a. Kumkhuain min lainat reng a ni’ tih an sa ta tuar tuar a. Lalpa in Tempul chhûngah chuan, chhûm a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chhûm chu Tempul chhûnga a khah tlat avângin puithiamte chuan rawng an bâwl thei lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona chu a ṭawngṭai a, “Chhûm thim zînga awm i duh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tûnah zawng, Tempul ṭha tak ka siamsak tâk che hi, kumkhuaa i awmna tûr chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chu chutah chuan an ding a, Solomona chuan an lam a hawi a, Pathian malsâwmna a dilsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chu fak rawh u, Ani chuan ka pa Davida hnêna a thutiam a rawn tihpuitlin tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan, ‘ka mite Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah aṭanga tûn thlengin Israel khawpui khawiah mah min biakna tûr Tempul sakna hmun ka la thlang lo. Chumi ti tûr chuan ka mi Israel tu mah ka la thlang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûnah zawng, min biakna hmun atân Jerusalem hi ka thlang ta a, nang David, ka mite chunga lal atân ka ruat a che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka pa, Davida khân Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa biakna tûr Tempul sak a tum a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mahse, Lalpa chuan ka Pa Davida hnênah, ‘Ka chênna tûr in min siamsak i tum hi i ti ṭha e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahse, nang chuan i sa lo vang, i fapa, i hrin ngeiin a ni Tempul chu sa dâwn ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan a thutiam chu a tipuitling ta a, a tiam angin ka pa Davida aiah lal ka lo ni a, a lalṭhutthlêng mi luahtîr a; he in hi Israel Pathian, Lalpa hming awmna atân ka sa zo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite nêna thuthlung a siam dahna bâwm pawh a chhûngah ka dah fel ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipui hmaah Solomona chu maichâm bulah a kal a, bân pharin a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomona khân dâr dawhkân, tawng nga bial, tawng thuma sâng a siam a, Tempul tuallaiah chuan a dah a. Dawhkân chungah chuan a lâwn a, vân lam hawia bân a phar chu mi tinin an hmu thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ṭawngṭai a: “Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, lei leh vânah nang ang rêng Pathian an awm lo. I mite nêna i thuthlung chu i vawng ṭhîn a, i thu an awih phawt chuan i hmangaihzia i lantîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pa, Davida hnêna i thutiam chu i hlen a, vawiin hian i tipuitling ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khai le, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, ka pa Davidan i dânte a pawisaka, a thlahten an pawisak ve phawt chuan ‘a thlah pakhat tal chu Israel lalah an ṭang reng ang,’ tih i tiam pawh kha han hlen teh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Davida hnêna i tiam zawng zawng kha, aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, han tihlawhtling teh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Pathian meuh chu lei mihringte zîngah hian i chêng duh ngût dâwn em ni? Vânah pawh i leng si lo va, ka Tempul sakah hian leng rual em i nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka Pathian, i chhiahhlawhin ka dîl hi lo ngaithla la, ka ngen hi min phalsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I hming awmna tûra i thlan, he in hi a chhûn a zânin vêng la, i lam hawia ka ṭawngṭai hi lo ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ṭawngṭaina hi ngaithla la, i mi Israel-te, he Tempul hawia an ṭawngṭai chuan ngaithla la. I in vân sâng aṭang chuan lo hria la, kan sual ngaidam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tu pawh, thil sual tia puh, i maichâm hmaa lo kala, tihsual a neih lohzia hriat nân chhia a rawn chham chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i vân sâng aṭangin lo ngaithla la, i chhiahhlawh chungthu chu dik takin rêlsak la, mi sual chu hrem la, pawi khawih lo chu chhuah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“An sual avânga i mi Israel-te chu an hmêlmaten an sawisaka, i lam an lo hawia, i Tempul hawia ngaihdam an rawn dîl chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I vân sâng aṭangin lo ngaithla la, i mite sual chu ngaidam la, an hnêna i pêk, an thlahtute i pêk ramah chuan hruai kîr leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“I mite sual avângin khua i khêntîr a, an sual sima Tempul hawia an rawn ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />aw Lalpa , an thu chu ngaihthlâksak la, i chhiahhlawh Israel-te sual chu ngaidam la; thil dik tih zirtîr ang che. Tin, aw Lalpa , i mite neih hlen tûra i pêk i ramah chuan ruah sûrtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Ṭam tlâk te, hri lên te, thli lumin thlai a chhêm chhiata, khau te a puana, râl an lo lente leh i mite an dam loh hritlân hunah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />an ṭawngṭaina chu ngaithla ang che. I mi Israel tu pawh sim takzeta i Tempul lam hawia a ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a dîl chu lo hria la, i vân sâng aṭangin ngaithla la, ngaidam ang che. Nangmah chauh hian mihring thinlung chhûngril chu i hmu thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />min thlahtute i pêk rama an awm chhûng chu nang hi an ṭih che a, i thu an awih theih nân an phu tâwk zêlin an chungah ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Hnam dang, Israel mi ni lo, ram hla taka awmte pawhin i ropuizia leh i thiltihtheihzia chu an hriata, i ṭanpui peih reng tih hriaa lo kalin he in lam hawia an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />an dîl chu ngaithla la, i chênna vân sâng aṭang chuan lo ngaithla la, an ngen chu tihsak ang che; khawvêla mi zawng zawngin i mi Israel-te angin an hre dâwn che nia. He ka Tempul sakah hian chibai an rawn bûk che a ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“An hmêlmate do tûra i mite an chhuaha, khawi aṭang pawhin i thlan he khua emaw, i tâna ka Tempul sak lam emaw hawia an ṭawngṭai chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />lo ngaithla la, vân aṭangin lo hria la, an hmêlmate chu hnehpui ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“I miten i laka thil sual an tiha, thil sual ti lo an awm si lo, i thin an tih-ura, an hmêlmate kuta i pêka, sala an hruaiin, an hruaina ram chu hla hle mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />i mite ṭawngṭai chu ngaithla ang che, chu ramah chuan an sual an sima, an sualna leh an khawlohnaah thupha an chawi chuan, aw Lalpa , an ṭawngṭaina chu ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chûng rama an awm hnuin an sual an sim takzeta, inchhîra an thlahtute hnêna i pêk ram lam te, i tâna i khawpui thlan lam te, i tâna ka sak he Tempul lam hawi tea an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />lo ngaithla la, i vân sâng aṭang chuan lo hria ang che; an chungah ngilnei la, i mite sualna zawng zawng chu ngaidam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Aw ka Pathian, min rawn thlîr la, he hmuna kan ṭawngṭai hi ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, lo thawk chhuak la, I chênna tûrah hian lo kal teh, I ropuizia lanna bâwm nên lo lût rawh, Aw Lalpa Pathian, i puithiamte chu an thiltih apiangah malsâwm la, I mi thianghlimte chu i thil ṭha tihsakah lâwm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, I hriakthiha hi hawisan suh la, I chhiahhlawh Davida thil ṭha tihte hre reng ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Solomona a ṭawngṭai zawh chuan vân aṭangin mei a lo tla a, thilhlante chu a rawn kâng ral ta a; Tempul chhûng chu Lalpa ropuina chuan a khat ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in chhûng chu a ropuinaa a khah tlat avâng chuan puithiamte chu Lalpa Tempulah chuan an lût thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vân aṭanga mei lo tla leh in chhûng Lalpa ropuinaa a khat chu, Israel miten an han hmuh chuan tualah an bawkkhup a, Pathian chibai an bûk a, a ṭhatna avâng leh ngil a neih kumkhua ṭhîn avângin an fak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Solomona leh mite chuan Lalpa hnênah thilhlan an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Remna thilhlan atân bâwng sînghnih leh sânghnih, berâm nuaikhat leh sînghnih an hlân a. Chutianga tiin Solomona leh a mite chuan Tempul chu an hawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiamho chu an dinna hmun tûra ruatah chuan an ding a, Levia chite chuan Davida pêk thil tum rîk theihte nên Lalpa fak hla, ‘Kumkhuaa min hmangaihtu a ni,’ tih hla, Davidan sa tûra a tih ang ngeiin an sa ta tuar tuar a, Puithiamte pawhin mipui ding hmaah tawtawrâwt an hâm ruai ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hung chhûng kawtlai pawh chu Solomona chuan a hawng a, hâlral thilhlan te, buhbâl thilhlan te, remna thilhlan ran thau te chu a hâl a, dâr maichâm a siam kha hêng zawng zawng hlan nân a tê lutuk a, a leng lo chu tualah chuan an hâl mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Solomona leh mi dangte chuan Bâwkte kût, ni sarih chhûng an hmang zui a, Israel ram hmâr tâwp lam Hamath kalkhân leh chhim lam Aigupta lui inkâra mi zawng zawng chu an lo kal khâwm a, mi an tam hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maichâm lawmin ni sarih a awh a, Bâwkte kût hian ni sarih dang a awh leh a, kût ni hnuhnûng berah chuan kût khârna inkhâwm ropui tak an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tûk leh thla sarihna, ni sawmhnih leh pathum ni chuan Solomona chuan mipuite chu a ṭintîr ta a. Lalpa chuan a mi Israel-te mal a sâwm a, Davida te, Solomona te mal a sâwm avâng chuan mipui chu an hlim êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ruat a nih ang ngeia lal Solomonan Tempul leh lal in a sak zawh fel vek hnu chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />zânah Lalpa chu a hnênah a rawn inlâr a, “I ṭawngṭaina ka lo hria a, Tempul hi ka hnêna thilhlan in rawn hlanna hmun atân ka thlang ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua ka tikhêng emaw, thlai ei chhe tûr khau ka tipuang emaw, hri ka lêntîr hunah emaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka hming putu ka mite hian thuhnuairawlh taka ka hnêna an rawn ṭawngṭaia, min rawn pana, an sualna ata an lo hawi kîr chuan vân aṭangin ka lo hria ang a, an sualte chu ka ngaidam ang a, an ramte pawh ka tungding leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tempul hi ka vil ang a, heta an ṭawngṭai chuan ka beng ka lo chhi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumkhuaa min biakna hmun atân ka thlang a, ka tihthianghlim tawh avângin ka vil ang a, ka vêng tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang pawh, i pa Davida tih anga i tiha, ka thupêkte i awiha, ka thuruatte i zawma, awm dân tûr ka tih anga i awm chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I pa Davida hnêna ka thutiam kha ka hlen ang; a thlahte chu Israel-te lalah an ṭang reng ang tih ka tiam a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In tâna ka thupêk te, ka thuruat te in ngaihsak lohva, in zâwm duh lohva, pathian dangte in biaka, an rawng in bâwl vaih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ka pêk che u ram ata hi ka paih chhuak ang che u a, min biak ṭhinna tûra ka Tempul ka tihthianghlim tawh pawh hi ka rauhsan ang a, mi tinin an nuihzat ang a, an hmusit bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tûnah chuan he in hi mi tinin an ngaisâng a, chutih hunah chuan a kianga kal apiangin mak an ti ang a, ‘Engtizia nge Lalpa hian he ram leh he Tempul hi heti taka a sawisak le!’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhatin, ‘An thlahtute Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu Lalpa , an Pathian chu an kalsan atin alâwm maw le; pathian dangte an vuan a, an rawngte an bâwlsan avângin Lalpa chuan a sawisa a nih hi,’ tiin an chhâng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Tempul leh ama in a sak chhûng kum sawmhnih a lo vei chuan Solomonan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hirama pêk khawpuite chu a din ṭha a, Judai rama mite a luahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomona chuan Hamath-zoba a bei a, a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thlalêra Tadmor kulh chu a siam ṭha a, Hamath biala khuate chu kudâm awm nân a siam ṭha bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Solomona chuan Beth-horon chuanchung leh chuanhnuai kulh bangte chu a rem ṭha a, kawngkhârte pawh a kalhnate nên a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baalat khawpui te leh kudâm a dahna khawpui te, a sakawrte leh a tawlailîr a dahna khawpui te pawh a siam ṭha leh vek a. Jerusalem-ah te, Lebanon-ah te leh a ram chhûng rêng rêngah in sak a tum tawh phawt chu a sa vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi ni lo, Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te, Jebus mi te, Kanan rama lo awm, Israel-ten Kanan ram an luaha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an thah bângte thlahte kha Solomona chuan bawih anga chhawr tûrin hnathawk pâwl a din a, chûng chu tûn thlengin an la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mite erawh chu hnathawk tûra phût luih an ni lo; sipaiah te, hotu-ah te, tawlailîr khalhtuah te leh sakawr chungchuang mi atân te an ṭang thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In sak hna enkawltu mi zahnih leh sawmnga an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomona chuan a nupui, Aigupta lal fanu tân in a sa a, Davida khawpui aṭang chuan a la chhuak a, a in sakah chuan a awmtîr ta a. “Ka nupui hi Israel lal Davida inah a awm tûr a ni lo. Thuthlung Bâwm awmna apiang hi Hmun Thianghlim a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tempul kawta maichâm a siamah Solomona chuan hâlral thilhlan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia dân bu-a chuang angin ni tina hlan tûr te, sabat nia hlan tûr te, thla thara hlan tûr te leh kum khat chhûnga kût vawi thum chhang dawidim telh loh kût te, Pentikos kût te, Bâwkte kûttea hlan tûr bi tukte chu a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa Davida ruat tawh angin puithiamte ni tin tih tûr a tihfelpui a, puithiamho zaia lo pui tûr Levia chite thawh tûr pawh a tihfelsak a. Tempul pulis-ho ni tin hna tûr te, kawngkhâr an vên tûr te, Pathian mi Davida sawi ang khân a ruat vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kudâm leh thil dang chungchâng puithiamte leh Levia chite hnêna Davida thupêk zawng zawng kha engkim a ti vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Tempul an sakna tûr lung an phûm ni aṭanga an peih fel thlenga Solomonan tih tûr a ruahman zawng zawng chu an ti ta vek a, Lalpa Tempul chu an puitlin ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Agaba litengsâwl, Edom rama Ezion-geber leh Eloth khuaah Solomona chu a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal Hirama chuan lawng leh lawngpu thiam tak tak a rawn thawn a, Solomona mite nên Ofir ramah an kal a, rangkachak kg. sîngkhat leh sângnga aia tam mah an rawn hâwn a, lal Solomona hnênah an rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Seba lalnuin Solomona hmingthanzia a hriat chuan thu har tak tak zâwta fiah tûrin Jerusalem-ah a kal a. Ṭhuihruai tam tak a nei a, mosola phur sanghâwngsei tam tak a hruai a, mosola te, lungmantam te, rangkachak te a keng ṭeuh bawk a. Solomona nên an inhmuh chuan zawh tûr a neih zawng zawng chu a zâwt ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A zawh zawng zawng chu Solomona chuan a chhâng thei vek a, chhan harsa tih rêng a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Seba lalnu chuan Solomona finzia chu a hria a, a in sak ropuizia te chu a hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Solomona ei tûr an rawn hlui te, a chhiahhlawh awmna in te, lal ina thawktu hna insem dân te, an thawmhnaw hâk mawizia te; chawhlui kîlpuitute leh a viltute inchei mawizia te, Tempula hâlral thilhlan a hlan hnemzia te a han hmuh chuan mak a ti a, awm ngaihna rêng a hre ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalnu chuan, “I thil tihte leh i finziate kan rama ka hriat kha a lo dik ngei a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lo kal a, ka rawn hmuh hma chuan an sawi chu ka awih lo va; mahse, i finziate hi a zâtve pawh an sawi hlei nem, an sawi ai daihin a ropui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I nupuite chu an va nihlawh êm! I chhiahhlawh, ni tina i bula awma, i finzia ngaithla ṭhîntute pawh hi an va nihlawh êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I Pathian, Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se, ani chu i chungah a lâwm a, a aia rorêltu, lalah a ruat che a ni. I Pathian chuan Israel-te hi a hmangaih a, an chungah dik taka rorêltu lalah a dah che a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thilpêk tûr a rawn ken rangkachak kg. sângli chuang leh mosola tam tak, lungmantam ṭhahnem tâwk tak nên Solomona chu a pe a. Seba lalnuin Solomona a pêk mosola anga ṭha rêng rêng hi a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal Hirama hote leh Solomona hote chuan Ofir rangkachak an rawn hâwn a, algum thing leh lungmantam pawh an rawn hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Algum thing chuan Tempul pindan chung leh ama in kailâwn a siam a, thing chu perhkhuang leh ṭingṭang siam nân a hmang bawk a, Judai ramah hetiang thing hi an la hmu ngai rêng rêng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Seba lalnu chu a duh leh a dîl apiang chu a pe a; chu bâkah thilpêk a rawn kensak lo do lêtna a pe tel bawk a; an ram lamah a ṭhuihruaite nên an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomona chuan kum tin rangkachak kg. sînghnih leh sângthum dâwn lai a dawng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sumdâwngte leh dâwrkaiten chhiah an pêk bâkah Arabia lalte leh Israel-te rama bial tin awptute chuan Solomona chu rangkachak leh tangka an rawn pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phaw lian pui pui, rangkachak den phêk zahnih a siam a, phaw pakhatah rangkachak kg. sarih vêl zêl a hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Phaw tê deuh rangkachak den phêk kg. thuma rita tuam a siam bawk a, ‘Lebanon ngaw in’ an tih pindanah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal chuan saingho lalṭhutthlêng ropui tak a siam a, rangkachak hlîr hlakin a tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng lâwn chhohna tûr rangkachak rahka paruk, rah chhan tûr nên a siam a. Ṭhutthlêng chuan bân a nei a, a bân sîr tawnah sakeibaknei lem a dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakeibaknei lem sâwm leh pahnih, rahka sîr tawnah chuan a bawhtîr bawk a, chutiang khawpa ropui chu khawi ramah mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Solomona no chu rangkachak vek a ni, ‘Lebanon ngaw in’ an tih pindana an thil eina bungbêlte pawh chu rangkachak hlîr hlaka siam a ni. Solomona hun lai chuan tangkaruate hi chu engah mah an ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lawngrual a nei bawk a, lal Hirama lawng rualte nên an inkawp a, Tarsis-ah te kalin kum thum danah an lo haw a, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, saingho te, zâwng te, ârâwn te an rawn hâwn ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal Solomona chu khawvêl lal dang zawng zawng aiin a hausa a, a fing zâwk bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomona hnêna Pathianin finna a pêk chu hre duhin an rawn pan huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangkarua leh rangkachaka thil siam te, puan te, râlthuam te, mosola te, sakawr te, sakawr puakphur chi te an rawn pe zut zut a, kum tin hetianga rawn ti hi an awm zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan sakawr vulhna hmun sângli a nei a, chûngah chuan a sakawr tawlailîr leh a sakawrte chu a dah a, indo sakawr pawh sîngkhat leh sânghnih a nei a, a ṭhen chu Jerusalem-ah a kawl a, a dang chu khaw hrang hrangah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eufretis luipui leh Filistia ram inkâr, Aigupta lui thleng ram chhûnga lal ber a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Solomona lal laiin Jerusalem khuaah chuan tangkarua chu lungtê ang lek a ni a, sidar thing lah tlâng bulṭhut khawthlang phaia theipui thing ang maiin a tam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomona chuan Aigupta ram leh hmun hrang hrang aṭangin sakawr a tawlh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin Solomona chanchin hi zâwlnei Nathana lehkhabu-ah te, Silo mi Ahiza thu sawi ziakna bu-ah te, Nebata fapa Israel lal Jeroboama chungchânga zâwlnei Idoa inlârna ziakna bu-ah te a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomona chu Jerusalem-ah Israel zawng zawng chungah kum sawmli a lal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, a fapa Rehoboama chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboama chu Sekem khuaah a kal a, chutah chuan lala siam tûrin Israel-ho, hmâr lama awmte chu, an lo pung khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nebata fapa Jeroboama, Solomona hlauva tlân bo chu, Solomona thih hnu chuan a lo hâwng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmâr lama Israel-te chuan an va pun a, Rehoboama hnênah chuan an kal ho ta a, a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“I pa khân min chhawr nasa a, kan phur a tirit êm êm a; nangin min chhawr nêpin kan phur min tihzânsak deuh la, i khua leh tuiah kan awm ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Ni thum hnuah lo kal leh ang che u,” a ti a, mite chu an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama chuan a pa Solomona dam laia a bula awm ṭhîn upate chu a râwn a, “Hêng mite hi engtin nge chhâng ila min tih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hêng mite chungah hian ngilnei la, ṭha takin bia ang che, I mi an ni kumkhua ang,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Upaho thurâwn chu a ngaithla duh lo va, tlangvâl, ama rualpui, a kawm ṭhînte chu a râwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ ‘I pa khân kan phur a tirit êm êm mai, min tihzânsak rawh,’ rawn titute hi engtin nge ka lo chhân ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A rualpui tlangvâlte chuan, “Hêngho, ‘i pain kan phur a tirit êm a, min tihzânsak rawh,’ titute hi heti hian chhâng mai rawh, ‘Ka kutzungtê pawh hi ka pa kâwng ai chuan a khauh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ka pain in phur a tirit hle a nih chuan kei chuan ka belhchhah ang; vuakna hruia a hrem ṭhinnaah che u kei chuan khawmualkaikuang ka ruai ang,’ ti ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni thum hnuah chuan Jeroboama leh Israel-te chu Rehoboama hnênah, a sawi ang khân an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chuan upaho thurâwn kha zâwm duh lovin mite chu ram takin a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlangvâlho thurâwn ang khân Rehoboama chuan mite hnênah, “Ka pa chuan in phur a tirit hle maw? Kei chuan ka belhchhah ang. Vuakna hruiin a hrem ṭhîn che u a, kei chuan khawmualkaikuangin ka hrem ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal chuan mipui thu chu a ngaihthlâksak duh ta lo va, Silo mi zâwlnei Ahija hnêna Nebata fapa Jeroboama chungchâng Pathianin a sawi kha Lalpa chuan a tihhlawhtlin theih nân Pathianin a tihtîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite chuan lalin an thu a ngaihsak duh lo tih an hriatin lal chu an chhâng a: “Davida ramah chan eng nge kan neih ve le? Jesaia thlahte zîngah chanvo eng nge kan neih? Davida thlahte chu an awm awmin awm rawh se,” an ti a. Israel mi zawng zawng chu in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judai rama awm Israel mite chungah chauh chuan Rehoboama chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama chuan Hadorama, hnathawka phût luih pâwl hotu chu Israel-ho ko tûrin a tîr a, anni chuan lungin an lo dêng hlum a. Chumi avâng chuan Rehoboama chu a tawlailîrah a chuang sawk sawk a, Jerusalem-ah a tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuta chin chu Israel mite chu Davida thlahte lakah tûn thlengin an hel ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Rehoboaman Jerusalem a thlen chuan Benjamin mi leh Juda sipai ṭha ṭha nuaikhat leh sîngriat a khâwm a, hmâr lama awm Israel-te chu a thuhnuaia dah leh tûrin beih a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mahse, Pathian mi, Semaia hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama te, Juda leh Benjamin mite hnênah chuan heti hian a hrilhtîr a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“In unau Israel-te chu bei suh u, haw rawh u. An thil tih chu ka thu-a ti an ni,” tiin. Lalpa thupêk chu an awih a, Jeroboama chu an bei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboama chu Jerusalem-ah a awm a, Judai ram leh Benjamin-ho ram chhûnga hêng khuate hi kulhin a hung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem te, Etam te, Tekoa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Beth-zur te, Soko te, Adulam te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gath te, Maresa te, Zif te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adoraim te, Lakis te, Azeka te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zora te, Aijalon te, Hebron te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêng khaw kulhte hi rinawm takin a siam a, khaw tin tân hotu a ruat a, khaw tinah buh te, oliv hriak te, uain te a chhêk bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fei te, phaw te a dah bawk a; chutiang chuan Judai ram leh Benjamin ram mite chu a thuhnuaiah a dah thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel-ho rama bial tina awm puithiamte leh Levia chite chuan chhim lam an pan a, Judai ramah an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levia chite chuan an ran tlatna leh an ram chante chu an kalsan a, Judai ramah te, Jerusalem-ah te an lo kal a. Jeroboama leh a aiawhtute khân Lalpa puithiamah an hmang duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeroboama khân hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsânga rawngbâwl tûr, bâwngpa lem a siam chawpte leh ramhuai biakna hmuna thawk tûr ama puithiam a ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel hnam zînga Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian be tak tak duhtute chuan Jerusalem-ah Levia chite chu an rawn zui a, an thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa hnênah thilhlan an hlan theih nân an lo kal ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian Judai ram chu Solomona fapa Rehoboama lamah chuan an ṭang a, lal Davida leh Solomona lal lai ang mai khân an khawsa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rehoboama chuan Davida fa, Jeremota fanu Mahalati nupuiah a nei a, a nu chu Eliaba fanu, Jesaia tunu Abihaili a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Fapa pathum - Jeusa te, Semaria te, Zahana te an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nakin deuhvah chuan Absaloma fanu Maaki a nei leh a, fapa pali - Abija te, Ataia te, Ziza te, Selomita te an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboama hian nupui sâwm leh pariat leh hmei sawmruk a nei a, fapa sawmhnih leh pariat leh fanu sawmruk a nei a. A nupui leh a hmei zawng zawng zîngah Maaki hi a duh ber a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abija hi a fa zawng zawng zîngah a duat ber a, a aiawha lal atân a thlang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rehoboaman a fate chhawr dân a thiam hle, Judai leh Benjamin ram chhûng khawpui kulh nei zawng zawngah hotu-ah a dah darh a. An lakah a thilphal hle a, nupuite pawh a neihsak thluah hlawm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboama chuan a lo lal ngheh tâk veleh a mite nên Lalpa dân chu an ngaihthah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rehoboama kum nga a lal kum chuan Lalpa an thlahthlam avângin hrem an tuar ta a, Aigupta lal Sisaka chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />sakawr-tawlailîr sângkhat leh zahnih, sakawr chungchuang mi sîngruk leh sipai chhiar sên loh, Lub te, Suki te leh Sudan sipai rual te nên Jerusalem chu a rawn bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judai ram khaw kulh neite chu a la tawh a, Jerusalem pawh a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama leh Judai ram hruaitu, Sisaka hlauva Jerusalem-a lo tlânte hnênah chuan zâwlnei Semaia chu a kal a, an hnênah, “Hei hi Lalpa thu chu a ni. Min kalsan a, kei pawhin Sisaka kuta awm tûrin ka kalsan ta che u a ni,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal leh hotute chuan, “Thil sual kan ti a ni, Lalpa hian a tidik e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thiltih chu a hriatin Lalpa thu chu Semaia hnênah a lo thleng leh a, a hnênah, “ ‘Thil sual kan ti’ an tih tâk avângin ka tiboral lo vang. Sisakan Jerusalem a rawn beih hunah, ka thinurna chu Sisaka hmangin an chungah ka leihbaw vek lo vang a, a ṭhen chu an dam khawchhuah ka phal dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sisaka chuan khua chu a la ang a, lei lal rawngbâwl leh ka rawngbâwl inan lohzia an hria ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sisaka chuan Jerusalem chu a rawn bei a, a Tempul leh lal ina thil hlu awmte chu a la vek a. Lal Solomonan rangkachak phaw a siamte nên, engkim a la vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng aiah chuan Rehoboama chuan dâr phawte a siam a, lal in kawngkhâr vêngtute kutah a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal chu Tempula a kal apiangin vêngtute chuan phawte chu an keng a, an zui a; vênbûkah an dah kîr leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna tlâwm taka a intukluh tâk avângin, Lalpa thinur chuan a sawisa hrep ta lo. Judai ram mite pawh an khawsa nuam viau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rehoboama chu Jerusalem-ah a lal a, a intinghet ta hle. Lal a nihin kum sawmli leh pakhat a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh pasarih ro a rêl a. Israel ram zawng zawngah chu khua chu amah chibai bûkna hmun atân Lalpa chuan a thlang a ni. Rehoboama nu chu Amon mi, Naamaii a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa duhzâwng a ngaihtuah lo va, thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin Rehoboama thiltih leh a chhûngte chanchin chu ‘Zâwlnei Semaia chanchin’ ziakna lehkhabu-ah a chuang. Rehoboama leh Jeroboama chu an indo reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rehoboama chu a thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, a fapa Abija chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel lal Jeroboama kum sâwm leh pariat a lal kumin Abija chu Judai ram lal a ni ṭan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah kum thum a lal a, a nu chu Gibea khaw mi Uriela fanu Mikaii a ni. Abija leh Jeroboama chu an indo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abija chu sipai huai thlan ṭhalh nuai li nên a thawk a, Jeroboama chuan sipai huai ṭhalh bawk nuai riat nên a rawn bei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Efraim tlângram Zemaraim tlângchhîpah Abija chu a ding a, Jeroboama leh Israel-te chu a au va, “Ka thu hi lo ngaithla teh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan, Davida leh a thlahte hnênah Israel mite chunga lal nihna chu thu thlung meuhvin a pe tawh a ni tih in hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida fapa, Solomona chhiahhlawh Nebata fapa Jeroboama chu a pu lakah a hel ta mai a, mi lawilo pui puiin an ṭawiawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomona fapa Rehoboama chu an pawisa lo va; ani lah a la naupangin chûngho ngam tûrin a rilru a la puitling si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida thlahte hnêna lal thuneihna Lalpa pêk dodâlin in sipai ngah leh Jeroboama bâwng lem, in pathian atâna a siam chhuangin in lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa puithiamte leh Levia chite chu in hnawt chhuak a, hnam dang tih dân angin puithiam tûr in ruat chawp a. Bâwngpa rawn kai nazawng leh berâm pasarih emaw rawn khalh apiang chu, ‘kan puithiam’ in tih atân puithiamah in lo serh hrang duh zêl mai bawk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Keini zawngin kan Pathian Lalpa rawng a ni kan la bâwl, kan la hawisan lo, Arona thlah puithiam ngeiin an tih tûr an ti a, Levia chi ngatin an pui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûk tin leh tlai tin Lalpa tân rimtui an hâl a, hâlral thilhlante pawh an hlân ṭhîn a ni. Chhang serh chu dawhkân thianghlimah an dah ziah a, tlaiah rangkachak khâwnvâr pawh an la hâl ziah a ni. Keini chuan Lalpa thupêk kan la zâwm zêl a, nangni erawh chuan ani chu in thlah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian chu min hruaitu a ni a, a puithiamte pawh inbeihna tawtawrâwt hâm tûrin an inpeih reng a ni. Aw Israel-te u, in thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa hi do lul suh u, in ngam lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutih chhûng chuan Jeroboama chuan a sipai ṭhenkhat chu Juda sipaite ep tûrin a dah a, a ṭhen chu an hnung lama châng ru tûrin a kaltîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda-ho chuan an han thlîr vêl a, an hmêlmate chuan an lo hual vek tawh a, Lalpa chu an au va, puithiamte chuan tawtawrâwt an hâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda-te chu an au chiam a, Abija chuan hma a hruai a, an bei a, Pathian chuan Jeroboama leh Israel-te chu a hneh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel-te chu Juda-te hmaah chuan an tlânchhia a, Pathian chuan Juda-te chu a tichak ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abija leh a sipaite chuan Israel sipaite chu an titlâwm dêr mai a. Israel sipai ṭha ṭha nuainga zet chu an that a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Juda-te chuan an thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu an rinchhan avângin Israel-te chu an hneh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abija chuan Jeroboama sipaite chu a ûm a, an khawpui ṭhenkhat Bethel te, Jesana te, Efron te chu an chhehvêl khuate nên a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abija dam chhûngin Jeroboama chu a ding chhuak leh hman lo, Lalpa chuan a tihlum ta nge nge a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abija erawh chu a chak tial tial a, nupui sâwm leh pali a nei a, fapa sawmhnih leh pahnih leh fanu sâwm leh paruk a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abija chanchin dang, a thu sawi leh a thil tihte chu zâwlnei Idoa chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Abija chu a thi a, Davida khawpuia lal thlânah an phûm a. A fapa Asa chu a lo lal a. Asa lal kum sâwm chhûng chu râlmuang takin an awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa chuan thil dik leh thil ṭha, a Pathian, Lalpa hmuhah chuan a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hnam dang maichâmte leh an pathian biakna hmunsângte chu a tibo va, an lung milemte chu a tibung a, Aseri lim an phunte chu a kit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judai ram mite chu an thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa duhzâwng ti tûr leh a dânte leh a thupêkte zâwm tûrin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai ram khaw tina hnam dang Pathian biakna hmunsângte leh an rimtui hâlna maichâmte chu a tibo va, a lal lai chuan râlmuang takin an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan râl a tihmuansak a, indona a awm loh chhûng hian Judai ramah kulhte a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judai ram mite hnênah, “Ti rawh u, kan khuate hi din ṭha ila, lung kulh siam hnan ila, râlvênbûk in sângte, kawngkhâr leh a kalhna te i siam ang u. Lalpa , kan Pathian chu bulpuia kan neih avângin he ramah hian thu kan la nei a ni; amah chu kan pawm avângin kil tinah râlmuang takin min awmtîr a nih hi,” a ti a. Kulhte chu an siam a, ṭha takin an zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Asa chuan phaw leh fei keng, Judai ram aṭangin sipai nuaithum leh Benjamin ram aṭangin indo thiam, awmphaw ha leh thal keng sipai nuaihnih leh sîngriat a nei a; mi huai indo thiam tak vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia mi Zera chuan sipai maktaduai khat leh sakawr-tawlailîr zathum hruaiin Judai ram a rawn rûn a, Maresa a lo thleng hial tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lo do tûrin lal Asa chu a thawk chhuak a, Maresa bul, Zefata ruamah chuan an inep ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa chu a Pathian, Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , sipai chak lo zâwk a chak zâwk aia tichak theitu, nang ang an awm lo. Aw Lalpa kan Pathian, min rawn ṭanpui teh, nangmahah kan innghat a, i hming chhâlin hêng mite hi bei tûrin kan lo thawk a ni. Aw Lalpa , kan Pathian i nih hi, mihringin ngam che suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Ethiopia mite chu Asa leh Juda sipaiho hmaah chuan a hneh a, an tlânchhe ta chum chum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asa leh a hote chuan Gerar thleng rawkin an ûm a, Ethiopia mite chu an that hnem khawp a, lo ṭang tham pawh an awm tawh lo. Lalpa leh a sipaite chu an ngam hlawl lo va ni, sipaiho chuan râllâk sum tam tak an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gerar leh a chhehvêl khawpuia awmte chuan Lalpa chu an hlauh tâk êm avângin chûng khuate chu an tichhe thei ta vek a. Khuate chu an rawk a, râllâk sum tam tak an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Berâmpu bûkte pawh an hâl a, berâm tam tak an man a, sanghâwngsei te an man a, Jerusalem-ah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Obeda fapa Azaria chungah Pathian Thlarau a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Asa hmu tûrin a kal a, a au va, “Lal Asa, nangni Judai leh Benjamin mite u, ka thu hi ngaithla teh u. A lama in ṭan chhûng chuan Lalpa pawh in lamah a ṭang ang; in zawn chuan in hmu ang a, in hawisan chuan a hawisan ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-te chu Pathian tak be lovin rei tak an awm a, zirtîrtu tûr puithiam an nei lo va, dân an hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mahse, manganna an tawhin Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian lam chu an hawi a, Amah chu an zawng a, an hmu ṭhîn a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan ram chu a buai a, a mumal loh êm avângin vâk chhuak ṭha ngam pawh an awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam khatin hnam dang an tirethei a, khaw khatin khaw dang an tirethei bawk a. Pathian chuan buaina leh manganna an chungah a thlentîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan zâm lovin ṭan la rawh u. In thil tih rah chu in hmu ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Asa chuan Obeda fapa zâwlnei Azaria thu a han hriat chuan a huai phah sawt a, Judai leh Benjamin rama milem awm zawng zawng chu a tibo vek a, a pain tlângram khua a lâk zawng zawnga mi pawh a tibo vek a. Tempul tuala Lalpa maichâm pawh a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a awmpui tih an hriatin Efraim ram aṭang te, Samaria-ho ram aṭangte chuan a lamṭang mi tam takin Asa chu an rawn bêl a. Asa chuan chûngho chu Judai ram leh Benjamin rama mite nên a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asa lal kum sâwm leh panga kum, a thla thumnaah chuan Jerusalem-ah an pung khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan an râllâk bâwng zasarih leh berâm sângsarih Lalpa hnênah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu rilru tak leh tihtakzeta be tûrin thu an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Puitling pawh, naupang pawh, mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa be duh lo chu tihhlum tûr,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ring taka auvin Lalpa hming chhâlin chhia an chham a; an thu thlun chu vawn tlat an tiam a, an au va, tawtawrâwt an hâm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tihtakzeta thu an thlun tlân tâk avângin Judai ram mite chu an lâwm êm êm a. Lalpa rawngbâwl chu nuam an ti a, ani chuan a lo pawm a, kil tinah rem a lêntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal Asa chuan, a pi lalnu Maakin Aseri lim tenawm tak chu a phun avângin lalnu a nihna a hlihsak a. Aseri lim chu a kit a, a ek a, Kidron lui ruamah a hâl vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ram chhûnga hmunsâng, pathian dang an biakna zawng zawng chu Lal Asa chuan tibo vek lo mah se a dam chhûng chuan Lalpa chauh a vuan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa Abijan Pathian hnêna a thilpêk zawng zawng chu Asa chuan Tempulah a dah a; amah ngeiin rangkachak leh tangkarua a hlante pawh chu a dah tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asa chuan kum sawmthum leh panga ro a rêl chhûng chuan indona a awm leh ta lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai rama Asa kum sawmthum leh paruk a lal kumin Israel lal Baasa chuan Juda lal Asa ram aṭanga tu mah an lo chhuah loh nân leh tu mah an luh theih loh nân Rama-ah kulh a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa chuan Tempul sum bâwm ata tangkarua leh rangkachak a la chhuak a, Damaska khuaa awm Suria lal Ben-hadada hnênah a thawn a, a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa leh i pa an ṭangrual ang khân keini pawh i ṭangrual teh ang. En teh, tangkarua leh rangkachak ka rawn thawn a che, Israel lal Baasa nên in inṭhianna titâwp la, ka ram ata a sipaite hnuk kîr teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ben-hadada chuan Asa thu rawt chu ṭha a ti a, sipai hotu a ko va, Israel ram chu an rûn ta a; Ijon te, Dan te, Abel-maim te leh Naftali-ho biala kudâm awmna khua zawng zawng chu a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng thil chu lal Baasan a hriatin Rama khaw kulh a siam chu a chawlhsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rama kulh siamna tûr lung leh thingte chu la lutin Juda ram mi zawng zawng chu Asa chuan a pun a, Geba leh Mizpa kulh siam nân a hmang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan zâwlnei Hanania chu lal Asa hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa i Pathian rinchhan lovin Suria lal i rinchhan vei a; chuvângin, Israel lal sipaite chu i chhuah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethiopia leh Libua mite khân sipai leh sakawr-tawlailîr tam tak leh sakawr chungchuang mi tam tak an nei a ni lâwm ni kha? Mahse, Lalpa chu i rinchhan a, a hnehtîr che a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan amah ring tlattute chu ṭanpui tûrin khawvêl pum puiah a mit a lên ruai ruai ṭhîn a ni. Tûn aṭang chuan do tûr i nei reng ang. Âtthlâk takin thil i ti a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zâwlnei chungah chuan Asa chu a thinur ta hle a, kawl a buntîr a, ripah a khung a, chuta chinah chuan mi dang chungah pawh râwng taka kut thlâk a chîng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa lal ṭan tirh aṭanga a tâwp thleng chanchin chu ‘Juda leh Israel lalte chanchin’ ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asa chu kum sawmthum leh pakua a lal hnuin a ke a pân a, a ke a lo bai ta a. Mahse, Lalpa pan lovin daktor a pan zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kum hnih hnu chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida khawpuiah, a thlân atâna a kerah chuan an phûm ta a. Phûm hmain mosola te, tel rimtuite an hnawih a, amah sûn nân meipui an chhêm hluah hluah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehosafata chu a pa Asa hnuah a lo lal a, Israel-te do thei tûrin a intichak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judai ram kulh awmna khuaahte sipai a dah a, Judai ram thingtlâng leh Efraim rama khawpui, a pa Asan a lo hneh tawh khuaahte pawh sipai hmunpui a dah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pain a lal tirh laia a tih ang khân Jehosafata pawhin a ti a, Baal a be duh lo va. Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pate Pathian rawng a bâwl a, Pathian thupêk a zâwm a, Israel lalte angin a khawsa ve hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan Jehosafata chu Judai ramah a lal nghehtîr ta hle a, mite chuan chhiah an rawn pe zut zut a, a hausa ta viau va, mite pawhin an ngaisâng hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa rawngbâwl chu a châkzâwng a ni a, Judai rama an milem pathian biakna hmunsângte, Aseri limte chu a tibo vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum thum a lal hnu chuan Ben-haila te, Obadia te, Zekaria te, Nethanela te, Mikaia te chu Judai ram khawpuiah zirtîrtuah a tîr chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levia chi mi pakua leh puithiam pahnih an kal ve a, Levia chite chu Semaia te, Nethania te, Zebadia te, Asahela te, Semiramota te, Jehonathana te, Adonija te, Tobija te, Tobadonija te an ni a, puithiamte chu Elisama leh Jehorama an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa dân lehkhabu chu kengin Judai ram khua chu an fang chhuak a, mite chu an zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An vêl ram zawng zawng chu Jehosafata do ngam lo tûrin Lalpa chuan a tidawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistia mi ṭhenkhat chuan chhiahah tangkarua leh thilpêk tam tak Jehosafata chu an rawn kensak a. Arab mi ṭhenkhat pawhin berâm sângsarih leh zasarih leh kêl sângsarih leh zasarih an rawn pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehosafata chu a lal tulh tulh a, Judai ram dung leh vângah kulhte a siam a, khawpuite a din a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûngah chuan ei tûr a chhêk ṭeuh bawk a. Jerusalem khuaah a sipai hotu lian huaisen tak tak chu a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A chi chiin mahni chi hotu an nei a, Juda thlah sipai hotu ber chu Adna a ni, sipai nuaithum a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A dawttu chu Jehohanana a ni, sipai nuaihnih leh sing riat a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pathumna chu Zikria fapa Amasia a ni, sipai nuaihnih a ho va (Amasa hi hetianga Lalpa rawngbâwl tûra inpe a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin thlah sipai hotu ber chu, sipai chhuanawm tak Eliada a ni, sipai nuaihnih, âwmphaw leh thal keng a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dawttu chu Jehozabada a ni, indo inpeih reng sipai nuaikhat leh sîngriat a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judai rama kulh nei khuatea sipai a dah bâkah hêng hi Jerusalem-a a sipai awmte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Jehosafata chuan a lo hausaka, a hmingthan tâk hle hnu chuan Israel lal Ahaba nên inkawp zai an rêl a, an fate an inneihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum eng emaw zât hnuah Jehosafata chu Samaria khuaah Ahaba tlawh tûrin a chhuk a. Jehosafata leh a ṭhiante lawm nân Ahaba chuan berâm leh bâwng tam tak a talh a, ruai a ṭheh a. Gilead biala Ramot khua bei tûrin a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ramot khua chu bei tûrin i kal ve thei ang em?” a ti a. Jehosafata chuan, “I inpeih hun hunah kei leh ka sipaite chu kal kan inpeih e, kan pui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Lalpa i râwn hmasa zet ang,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahaba chuan zâwlnei zali dâwn lai rual chu, “Ramot khua ka bei ang nge bei lo vang?” tiin a zâwt a. Anni chuan, “Bei rawh, Pathian chuan a awmpui ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jehosafata chuan, “Zâwlnei dang Lalpa min râwnsak thei tûr an awm lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahaba chuan, “Mi pakhat, Imla fapa Mikaia chu a la awm a. Mahse, thil ṭha eng mah min hrilh lâwksak ngai lo va, ka haw hle a ni. Thil ṭha lo tak tak hrilh lâwk a chîng a,” a ti a. Jehosafata chuan, “Lal meuhvin chuti êma tih tûr emaw ni le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan hotu pakhat a ko va, Mikaia hruai tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal pahnih chu Samaria khawpui kawngka pâwn hruihah, lalṭhutthlêng an chhawpah chuan an ṭhu a; zâwlnei rual chuan an kal hual a, thu an sawi bual bual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An zînga pakhat, Kenaana fapa Zedekia chuan thîr, seki lem a siam a, Ahaba hnênah, “Suria-ho chu hêng nên hian i bei ang a, i tudawl dêr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zâwlnei dangte pawh chuan chutiang bawk chuan an ti a. “Kal la, Ramot khua chu han bei rawh, i la ngei ang. Lalpa chuan a hnehtîr ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mikaia hruaitu tûra an tirh chuan a hnênah, “Zâwlnei dang zawng zawngin a ṭha lamin lal hnênah thu an sawi a, nang pawhin chutiang chuan sawi ve mai ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “ Lalpa , mi nung hming chhâlin ka sawi e, ka Pathianin sawi tûra min hrilh chu ka sawi ang” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal Ahaba hma a va thlen chuan lal chuan, “Mikai, lal Jehosafata nên Ramot khua kan han bei ang nge bei lo vang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “Han bei teh rêng u, in hneh mawlh ang, Lalpa chuan hnehtîr che u ang hmiang,” a ti a. Ahaba chuan, “ Lalpa hminga ka hnêna thu i sawiin thu dik chauh mi hrilh tûrin vawi eng zât nge ka hrilh dâwn che?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “Vêngtu nei lo berâm rual angin tlânga Israel-ho an darh ka hmu a ni. ‘Hêngho hian hruaitu an nei lo; mahni in lamah dam têin haw dial mai rawh se,’ Lalpa chuan a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Jehosafata hnênah, “Kha maw, ka tâna thil ṭha tûr eng mah a sawi ngai lo ka tih rêng kha. Thil ṭha lo lam hlîr a ni a sawi ṭhin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “ Lalpa thu hi lo ngaithla teh. Lalpa chu vâna a lalṭhuthlêngah a ṭhu ka hmu a, vântirhkohte chuan an din hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Tu nge Ahaba chu Ramot beia thi tûrin zu bum ang?’ Lalpa chuan a ti a. Vântirhkoh ṭhenkhat chuan thu khat an sawi a, a dang chuan thu dang an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thlarau pakhat hi a lo kal a, Lalpa hmaah a va ding a, ‘Ka zu bum ang e’ a ti a. Lalpa chuan, ‘Engtin nge i bum ang?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlarau chuan, ‘Ahaba zâwlneite chu dâwt ka zu sawitîr ang,’ a ti a. Lalpa chuan, ‘Kal la, chutiang chuan zu ti rawh, i bum ngei ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a ni Lalpa chuan hêng zâwlneiho hi i hnêna dâwt a sawitîr ni. Lalpa ngeiin i chhiatna tûr a ruat tawh a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zâwlnei Zedekia chuan Mikaia chu a va pan a, a bêng a, “Engtik lai khân nge Lalpa thlarauvin min kalsana i hnêna a awm tâk le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mikaia chuan a chhâng a, “Pindan chhûngrila i bihrûk hunah i hre mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahaba chuan hotu pakhat hnênah, “Mikaia kha man la, khaw awptu Amona hnênah hruai la, lal fapa Joasa pawh hmuhtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dam taka ka lo kîr leh hma chu ripah khung sela, chhang leh tui chauh pe rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “Dam taka i lo kîr leh hrim chuan Lalpa hian min be lo a ni ang; ka sawi hi mi tinin hre rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal Ahaba leh lal Jehosafata chu Gilead biala Ramot khua bei tûr chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Jehosafata hnênah, “Kan inbeih hunah ka inchei danglam ang a, nang chu lal incheiin inchei zêl ang che,” a ti a. Lal Ahaba chu a inchei danglam a, an inbeihnaah chuan a tel ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Suria lal chuan tawlailîr khalhtu hotu chu, “Israel lal chauh lo chu tu mah bei suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chûngho chuan Jehosafata an hmuh chuan Israel lal emaw an ti a, an rawn bei ta a. Jehosafata chu a au chiam a, Lalpa Pathian chuan a rawn chhâng a, a rawn beitute chu a tihkîrsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tawlailîr khalh hotute chuan Israel lal a ni lo tih an hriat chuan an ûm duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Suria sipai thal kâp mai mai hian lal Ahaba chu a râlthuam inkârah a kâp fuh palh a. A tawlailîr khalhtu hnênah chuan, “Hliam ka tuar e, lêt la, inbeihna hmun ata tlân chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An inbeih mup mup chhûng chuan Ahaba chu a tawlailîrah chuan Suria mite lam hawiin a ṭhu a, ni a tlâk chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem-a a inah Jehosafata chu dam takin a haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zâwlnei pakhat, Hanana fapa, Jehua chuan lal chu a hmu a, a hnênah, “Mi sual ṭanpuia Lalpa hawtute lama ṭan hi dik i ti em ni? I thiltih hian Lalpa thin a tiur hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin ṭhat vena zawng i nei e; miin an biak Aseri lim zawng zawng i ti bo va, Pathian duhzâwng zawn i tum hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehosafata chu Jerusalem-ah a awm a, a taima hle a; chhim tâwp Beer-seba aṭanga hmâr lam Efraim tlâng tâwp thlengin a khuate chu an thlahtute Lalpa Pathian lama hawi kîrtîr tumin a tlawh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai rama kulh nei khuaah tawh phawt chuan rorêltute a dah a, hetiang hian a hrilh zêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thu pawtchat mai mai suh ang che u, in hna hi mihring thu-a thawk in ni lo va, Lalpa thu-a rêl in ni a, in thu rêl chu Lalpa rêl a ni tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chu ṭih ula, fîmkhur takin engkim ti ang che u, Lalpa , kan Pathian chuan hlêprûk te, hleih neih te, thamna lâk te a hua a ni,” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaah chuan Levia chite, Puithiamte leh khaw hotu deuh ṭhenkhat chu rorêltu atân a ruat a; Lalpa dân bawhchhiat thu te, vântlâng zînga thubuai ngaihtuahtu tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Heti hian a ti a, “ Lalpa ṭih chungin in hna hi in thawk tûr a ni; in tih apiang rinawm takin ti zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawii khua aṭang pawhin in chipuiten mihring thah thu emaw, dân leh thupêk bawhchhiat thu emaw an rawn thlen chuan, an thu ngaihtuah chhûnga an awm dân tûr ngun takin hrilh ṭhîn ang che u; tichuan, Lalpa lakah thil sual in ti dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sakhaw lam thilah chuan puithiam lalber Amaria thu a lalber ang a, khawtlâng thilah chuan Judai ram awptu thu a lal ber a ni. Levia chite hian hêng rorêltute thu hi an kengkawh tûr a ni. Huai takin hêng hi zâwm sela, Lalpa chu mi dik lamah a ṭang ṭhîn a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nakin deuhvah chuan Moab leh Amon-ho chuan an kawppui Meun-ho nên Jehosafata ram chu rûn tûrin an lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat an lo kal a, Jehosafata hnênah, “Tuipui Thi râla, Edom ram aṭangin sipai tam takin an rawn bei dâwn a che, Hazazon-tamar khua pawh an la dêr tawh,” an ti a (Chu khua chu Engedi tih a ni bawk).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehosafata chu a thlaphâng hle a, thil tih dân tûrah Lalpa chu a râwn a. Ram pumah chaw nghei tûr a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judai ram khaw tin aṭangin Lalpa râwn tûrin Jerusalem-ah mi an lo kal zut zut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûngho leh Jerusalem-a mite chu Tempul tual siam tharah chuan an pung khâwm a, lal Jehosafata chu an hmaah a va ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ring takin a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , min thlahtute Pathian, thiltithei tak i ni, tu ma chelh rual i ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />He rama lo awm ṭhînte kha i mi Israel-te hmaah i hnawt chhuak a, i ṭhian, Abrahama thlahte neih kumkhua atân i pe a ni lâwm ni kha, aw kan Pathian?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />He ramah hian an awm ta a, nangmah biakna tûr Hmun Thianghlim an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Min hrem nân indona te, hri te, ṭâm te, thil ṭha lo tinrêng te lo thleng mah se, nangmah biakna tûra i ruat he in kawtah hian kan ding ang a, kan mangannaah chuan kan au vang che a, nangin min ngaihthlâksakin min chhanhim ang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Min thlahtute Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah pawh khân Amon-ho te, Moab-ho te, Edom-ho te kha rûn i phal lo va, an rama kal i phalsak lo va. Kan pute chuan an ram chu an kal hual a, an tichhe lo a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, tûnah hian ro atâna ram min pêk ata min hnawh chhuah tumin an lo thawh tâk thung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw kan Pathian, an chungah ro han rêl teh; min bei tûr sipaite hi an tam êm a, kan chêt theih tâk hlek lah hi. Tihngaihna rêng kan hre ta lo va, i hmaah kan rawn thlen ngawt mai a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judai ram mi zawng zawng chu an nupui fanaute nên Tempul kawtah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuta awm ve Levia chi mi pakhat, Zekaria fapa Jahaziela chungah Lalpa thlarau a lo thleng a. Ani chu Asafa thlaha mi a ni a, Zekaria chu Benaia fa a ni a. Benaia chu Jeiela fa a ni a, Jeiela chu Matania fa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jahaziela chuan, “Judai ram mi zawng zawng leh Jerusalem-a chêngte leh nang, Jehosafat, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘Sipai an tam avângin zâm suh ula, huphurh hek suh u. Indona chu Pathian kuta awm a ni, in kuta awm a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naktûkah Zif kalkhâna an lo chho chu lo bei ang che u. Phaizâwl thlen hmaa Jeruel bul, ram chhengchhe laiah lo châng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In beih a ṭûl lo vang. In awmna tûrah chuan lo châng ringawt mai rawh u. Lalpa chuan a hnehsak dâwn che u a ni. Judai ram leh Jerusalem mite u, zâm suh ula, huphurh hek suh u, bei tûrin thawk chhuak rawh u, Lalpa chu in lamah a ṭang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal Jehosafata chu a bawkkhup a, mipui pawh an kûn a; Lalpa chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Levia chi, Kohata leh Kora pâwlte chu an ding a, Israel-te Pathian Lalpa chu fakin ring takin an zai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tûkah chuan zîng takah an tho va, Tekoa khaw bul ram chhengchhe lam an pan a. Chutia an kal chhuah dâwn lai chuan Jehosafatan an hnênah, “Juda leh Jerusalem tlangvâlte u, Lalpa , in Pathian chu rinchhan ula, in dingchang ang. A zâwlnei thu sawi kha ring ula, in hlawhtling ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal chuan mite chu a berâwn a, Levia chi zaipâwlte chu hun serha an hâk tûr thawmhnawte inbela sipaiho hma hruai tûrin a ti a; ‘ Lalpa chu fak rawh u, kumkhuain ngil a nei si a,’ ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutia Pathian faka hla an han sak lai chuan Juda-te bei tûra lo thawk Amon-ho te, Moab-ho te, Edom-ho te châng ru tûrin Lalpan a dah a; tichuan, an hmaah chuan an hmelmate chu an tlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amon-ho leh Moab-ho chuan Edom-ho chu an bei a, an that phiar a; anmahni leh anmahni pawh chu intiboral tûrin an inbei ve leh ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judai ram sipaiten thlalêr in sâng an va thlen chuan, an hmêlmate lam chu an han thlîr a. An za chuan leiah an tlu thal phung a, an lo thi vek mai a, pakhat mah tlân chhuak an awm lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehosafata leh a hote chu râllâk sum la tûrin an kal a. Chûng zîngah chuan bâwng tam tak te, ei tûr te, thawmhnaw te leh thil hlu tak tak an hmu ṭeuh va. Râllâk sum lâk tûr a tam khawp a, ni thum chhûng ngawt an la khâwm a, an phurh sên loh khawp an la a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni li ni chuan ‘Beraka’ ruamah an pung khâwm a, an tâna a thiltih zawng zawng avângin Lalpa chu an fak a; chuvâng chuan chu hmun chu ‘Beraka’’ an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan an hmêlmate a hnehsak tâk avâng chuan Jehosafata leh a hote chu hlim takin Jerusalem-ah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jerusalem an thlen dâwn chuan ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te leh tawtawrâwt ri te nên Tempul an pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa Pathianin Israel-te chu an hmêlmate a dosak tih an chhehvêl hnamte chuan an lo hriatin Pathian chu an hlau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jehosafata chu râlmuang takin a lal a, Lalpa chuan kil tinah a vêng tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kum sawmthum leh panga a nihin Jehosafata chu Judai ramah a lo lal a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh panga a lal a. A nu chu Azubai, Silhia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pa Asa ang bawk khân Lalpa hmaah thil ṭha a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsâng a tichhe vek lo va, mipuite pawhin an thlahtute Pathian biak an la uar tehchiam hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehosafata thil tih dang zawng zawng, a lal tirh aṭanga a thih thleng thu chu Hanania fapa ‘Jehua chanchin’ tih bu-ah ziak vek a ni. Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu zîngah a tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Judai ram lal Jehosafata leh Israel lal Ahazia, thil dik lo ti ṭhîntu chu ṭhianah an insiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ezion-geberah Tarsis khuaa kal tûr lawng rual an tuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Maresa khaw mi, Dodavahua fapa Eliezara chuan Jehosafata hnênah, “Israel lal Ahazia te i thurualpui avângin Lalpa chuan i thil tih a tichhia ang,” a ti a. An lawng rual chu a keh zo va, Tarsis khuaa kal tûr awzâwng a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehosafata chu a thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, a fapa Jehorama chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judai ram lal Jehosafata fapa Jehorama chuan nau paruk - Azaria te, Jehiela te, Zekaria te, Azaria te, Mikaela te, Sefatia te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An pa chuan rangkachakte leh ro hlu tam tâwk tak a pe ṭheuh va, Judai ram khawpui kulh nei, an enkawl tûr a ruatsak vek bawk a. Jehorama chu a fapa upa ber a nih avângin Jehosafata chuan a aiah a laltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehorama chu a han lal ngheh chuan, a naute chu a thahtîr vek a. Israel zînga hotu ṭhenkhat pawh a thahtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum sawmthum leh pahnih a nihin Jehorama chu a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum riat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba leh lal dang sual tak tak angin a awm ve a, Ahaba fanu pawh nupuiah a nei a ni. Lalpa chungah thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpa chuan Davida hnêna a thuthlung avâng leh a thlahte chu laltîr reng a tiam tlat avângin Davida thlahte chu a tiral mai hreh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehorama lal laiin Juda-ho lakah Edom-ho chu an hel a, lal an nei hrang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehorama leh a hote chuan sakawr-tawlailîr nên Edom chu an va rûn a. Edom sipaite chuan an lo hual a; mahse, zân khaw thimah an pût ru thei hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuta chin chu Edom chuan Juda-ho hnuaia awm lovin tûn thlengin lal hran an nei ta reng a ni. Jehorama chuan, Lalpa , a thlahtute Pathian chu a ngaihsak loh avângin chutih hun lai vêl bawk chuan Libna khua chu an hel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judai ram tlângramah pathian dang biakna hmunsâng a siam thluah nghe nghe a. Judai ram leh Jerusalem mite chu Lalpa laka hela, thil sual ti tûrin a kaihruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zâwlnei Eliza chuan lehkha a thawn a, “I thlahtu Davida Pathian, Lalpa chuan i pa Jehosafata leh i pu Juda lal Asa te awm dân ang khân i awm ve loh avângin a thiam lo che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel lalte khawsak dân angin i khawsa zâwk hlauh va, Ahaban Israel mite pathian dang hnêna a uirepui ang khân nang pawhin Judai ram mi leh Jerusalem mite chu i uirepui a. Nang aia ṭha ṭha, i naute lah i that vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian Lalpa chuan i mite, i fa te, i nupui te hripuiin a hrem dâwn, i neih zawng zawng a tihchhiatsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangmah ngei pawhin rîl natna benvawn na tak i tuar ang a, ni tin a zual tulh tulh ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Filistia mi leh Arab mi ṭhenkhat, tuipui kama Ethiopia mi lo awmte bulah an awm a. Lalpa chuan chûngho chu Jehorama bei tûrin a chawk tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judai ram chu an han rûn ta a. Lal inte chu an rawk a, lal nupuite leh a fapate chu salah an man vek a. A fa tlum Ahazia erawh chu an man ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Lalpa chuan an lal pum chu a tina chiam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kum hnih dâwn lai chu a ni têlin a na tulh tulh a, a rîl a tla ta a, na tak tuarin lal chu a thi ta a. A pute thiha an tih angin a thih chuan a mite chuan amah sûn nân meipui an chhep ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehorama chu kum sawmthum leh pahnih a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum riat a lal a, a thihin pawi an ti lo. Davida khawpuiah chuan an phûm a, lal thlânah erawh chuan an phûm lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Arab mi ṭhenkhatin Jehorama chu an rûn a, a fa tlum Ahazia tih loh a fapa dang zawng zawng chu an thahsak avângin Jerusalem mite chuan a pa aiawh tûrin Ahazia chu lalah an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahazia chu kum sawmhnih leh pahnih mi a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum khat a lal a. A nu chu Athali, Israel lal Ahaba fanu, Omria tunu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani pawh a nu thurâwn ṭha lo tak a zawm ṭhîn avângin Ahaba chhûngte khawsak angin a khawsa ve ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti ṭhîn. A pa thih hnu chuan Ahaba chhûngte zînga mi ṭhenkhat chu a thu lâkna ber an ni ta a, a chhiat phah ta nghe nghe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An thurâwn angin Suria lal Hazaela do tûrin Israel lal Ahaba fapa Jorama a thurualpui a, Gilead biala Ramot khua an beih a, an inbeihnaah lal Jorama chu an hliam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ramoth-gilead-a Suria lal Hazaela a va beihnaa a hliam enkawl dam tûrin Jezreel-ah chuan a lo kîr a. Tichuan, Juda lal Jehorama fapa Ahazia chu Ahaba fapa Jorama dam lo tlawh tûrin Jezreel-ah a zu kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jorama a va tlawh chu Pathianin Ahazia chhiatna tûra a thil ruat a ni. An awm dun lai chuan mi pakhat Nimsia fapa Jehua a lo kal a; ani hi Ahaba chi timang tûra Lalpa mi tirh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehua chuan Ahaba thlahte chunga kut a thlâk lai chuan Jorama dam lo en tûr Ahazia ho - Juda hotute leh Ahazia laichînte chu Jehua chuan a hmu a, a that ve ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahazia chu a han zawng a, Samaria khuaah a lo biru a, Jehua hnênah an hruai a, a lo that ta a. Theihtâwp chhuaha Lalpa zawng ṭhîntu a pu Jehosafata chu an zah avângin a ruang chu ṭha takin an phûm a. Ahazia chhûng zînga mi lal tûr rêng an awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nu Athali chuan Ahazia tualthih thu a hriat veleh Judai lal chhûngte zawng zawng a thahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahazia khân farnu Jehosebi a nei a, puithiam Jehoiada chu pasalah a nei a. Ahazia fapa pakhat, Joasa chu, a rûkin a hum a, lal fa dang, tualthi mai tûrte zîng ata chu a la chhuak a, Tempula mutna pindan pakhatah a thukru a, a enkawl ta a. A thuhrûk tlat avângin Athali chuan a that ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutah chuan kum ruk a thukru a, Athali chu lalah a ṭang ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sarihnaah chuan puithiam Jehoiada leh sipai za hotu pangate chu an inrâwn ngam ta a. Chûng mite chu Jehorama fapa Azaria te, Jehohanana fapa Ismaela te, Obeda fapa Azaria te, Adaia fapa Maaseia te, Zikria fapa Elisafata te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judai ram an fang kual a, Levia chite leh hnam hruaitute chu Jerusalem-ah an hruai khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tempulah chuan an kal khâwm a, Joasa, lal fapa nên chuan thu an intiam a. Jehoiada chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan Davida thlahte chu lal tûrin a ruat a, hei hi lal thi ta-a fapa, lal tûra chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hetiang hian thil kan ti ang: Sabat nia lo kal ṭhîn puithiamte leh Levia chi hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chuan Tempul kawngkhârte an vêng ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chuan lal in an vêng ang a, a dang zawng zawng chu ‘Lungphûm’ kawngkhâr bulah an awm tûr a ni. Mipui chu Tempul tualah an lo kal khâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tempul chhûngah puithiam leh Levia chi, rawngbâwl lai tih loh chu, tu mah an lût tûr a ni lo. Anni chu serh hran an ni a, an lût thei ang; mi dang erawh chu Lalpa thu awihin an lût tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levia chite chuan lal hi an din hual ang a, khandaih phawi sa kengin an vêng tûr a ni, lal kalna apiangah an zui zêl tûr a ni. Tempula luh tum tawh phawt chu thah tûr an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan châwl tûrte chu a la chawlhtîr loh avângin, Sabat nia rawngbâwl tûrte leh châwl tûrte pawh chu an rawn hruai vek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davidan Tempula a dah, fei leh phawte chu Jehoiada chuan sipai hotute hnênah a sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tempul kawtah khandaih phawi sa kengin mi a din kualtîr a, lal chu a vêntîr tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan Joasa chu a hruai chhuak a, lal tih tûr dân bu chu a pe a, lalah an siam ta a. Puithiam Jehoiada leh a hote chuan Joasa chu hriak an thih a, “Lal hi dam reng rawh se,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Athali chuan lal an chawimawi thâwm chu a han hriat chuan mipui punkhâwmna Tempul lam chu a pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal thar chu lal dinna tûra an ruat Tempul chhûng luhna kiang ban bula a ding chu a han hmu a, sipai hotute leh tawtawrâwtpute chuan an din hual a. Mipui chu hlim takin an au dual dual a, tawtawrâwt an hâm a, Tempul zaipâwlte chuan an thil tum rîkte nên zai an hruai a. Chûng chu a han hmuhin mangangin a puan a pawtthlêr a, “Min phiarru a lo nih hi,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan Tempula thah a duh lo va, sipai hotute chu a ko va, “Vêngtu sipai kârah rawn hruai chhuak ula, chhan tum apiang chu lo that zêl ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Athali chu an man a, lal in lamah an hruai a, Sakawr kawngkhâr an tih bulah chuan an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa mi ni ngei tûrin puithiam Jehoiada chuan lal Joasa leh mipui chu thu a thlunpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baal an biakna hmunah chuan an za-in an kal a, an ṭhiat ta a. Maichâm chu an tichim a, milemte chu an chhu keh a, Baal puithiam Matana chu maichâm bulah an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan puithiamte leh Levia chite chu Tempula an hna tûr a thawhtîr a, lal Davida remruat angin tih tûr an semsak a, Mosia dân bu-a ziak angin Lalpa hnênah hâlral thilhlante an hlân a. Rimawi tum te, zai te leh zai hruai te pawh an tih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan Tempul kawngkhârte pawh a vêntîr a, mi bawlhhlawh tu mah an luhtîr tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sipai hotute, ram hruaitute leh mipuite chuan Jehoiada hovin kawng an zawh a. Lal chu Tempul aṭangin lal inah an hruai a, kawngkapuiah an luhpui a, lalṭhutthlêngah chuan lal chu a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng chu an hlim hle a ni. Athali chu khandaiha an thah tâk avângin khuaah chuan buaina a reh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joasa chu kum sarih a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmli a lal a, a nu chu Zibi, Beer-seba mi a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam Jehoiada dam chhûng chuan Joasa chuan Lalpa lawmzâwng hlîr a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan lal Joasa chu nupui pahnih a neihsak a, fanu leh fapa an hrinsak ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan Joasa chuan Tempul chei ṭhat zai a rêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puithiam leh Levia chite chu Judai ram khawpuite a fantîr a, kum tina Tempul chei ṭhatna daih tûr thawhlâwm a khawntîr a. Hmanhmawh tûrin a ti a; mahse, Levia chite chu an vuaicha hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehoiada chu a ko va, “Levia chite hian Judai ram leh Jerusalem mite hnên aṭangin ‘Biakbûk’ enkawlna tûr Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia tuk kha an khawn ṭhat leh ṭhat loh engati nge i enpui loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi sualnu Athali zuitute kha Tempulah an lût lui a, thil thianghlim tam tak Baal biaknaa hmanah an la chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan Levia chite chu thawhlâwm bâwm siama, Tempul luhna kawngkhâr bula dah tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem leh Judai ram zawng zawngah Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosian thlalêra mipui thawh tûr bi a ruat ang kha rawn keng zêl tûrin thu an than a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipuite leh an hruaitute chuan lâwm takin thawh tûr bituk zât chu an rawn keng a, bâwm chu an thlâk khat ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levia chite chuan bâwm chu ni tin, a enkawltu tûra lalin a ruat hnênah chuan an rawn dah ṭhîn a; bâwm chu a khah veleh puithiam lalber Jehoiada aiawhtu leh lal mi ruat ziaktu chuan an lo la chhuak a, bâwm chu a dahnaah an dah kîr leh ṭhîn. Tangka tam tâwk tak an thawh khâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal leh Jehoiada chuan Tempul chei ṭhat hna enkawltute hnênah pawisa chu an pe chhuak ṭhîn a; annin lung chher mi te, thing dek thiam te, thîrdêng te Tempul chei ṭha tûr chuan an ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngawrh takin mistiri te chuan hna an thawk a, Tempul chu a tîra mi anga nghet khân an chei ṭha leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hna thawh tûr an tih zawh chuan rangkachak leh tangkarua an hman bâng chu lal Joasa leh puithiam lalber Jehoiada an pe a; anni chuan Tempula rawngbâwl nân leh hâlral thil hlanna atân bungbêl te, rimtui hâlna thlêng te, rangkachak leh tangkarua a siam bungbêl te siam nân an lo hmang a. Jehoiada dam chhûng chu ni tin Tempulah chuan thilhlan an hlân ziah ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tarkûnin a dam a, kum za leh sawmthum a tlinin a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite zîngah Pathian tân leh Tempul tân thil a tih ṭhat êm avângin Davida khawpuia lal thlânah an phûm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada a thih tâk hnu chuan Judai ram mipui hruaitute chuan an thu ngaithla zâwk tûrin lal chu an hmin ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipui chuan an thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu Tempulah chuan an be duh ta lo va, milem te, pathiannu Aseri lemte an be ta zâwk a. An sualna avângin Judai ram mite leh Jerusalem mite chungah Lalpa chu a thinur ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan anni chu hruai kîr tûrin zâwlneite a tîr a; mahse, mite chuan an thu an lo ngaithla duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puithiam lalber Jehoiada fapa Zekaria hnênah Pathian thlarau a lo thleng a, mipuiin an hmuh theihna tûrah chuan a ding a, ring takin a au va, “ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Engtizia nge ka thupêkte zâwm duh lovin mahni chungah chhiatna in thlentîr dâwn le? Lalpa chu in kalsan avângin ani pawhin a kalsan che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zekaria chu an er hle a, lal thupêkin Tempul tualah chuan lungin an dêng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal chuan Zekaria pa Jehoiada kha a tân a ṭangkaizia kha a theihnghilh a, Zekaria chu a tihhlumtîr ta mai a ni. Zekaria thi tûr chuan, “I thil tih hi Lalpa chuan hmu sela, phuba la teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum a lo thar chuan Suria sipaite chuan Judai ram leh Jerusalem an rawn rûn a, hotu tam tak an that a, râllâk sum tam tak Damaska khuaah an hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Suria sipaite chu an tlêm hle nâ a, an aia tam daih Juda sipaite chu an hneh a ni. An thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu an kalsan avângin an chak lo va, Lal Joasa pawhin a tuar phah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joasa chuan hliam na tak a tuar a, hmêlmate chuan an kalsan ta a, a hote pahnih an inthurual a, puithiam lalber Jehoiada fapate a thah phuba chu an la a, khuma a mu chu an that a; lal thlânah ni lo, Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Inthuruala thattute kha Amon mi Simeata fapa Zabada leh Moab mi Simriti fapa Jehozabada te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalte lehkhabu hrilhfiahna bu-ah Joasa chanchin te, a chungchânga zâwlnei thu hril lâwk te, Tempul a chei ṭhat thu te a chuang. A fapa Amazia chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh panga a nihin Amazia chu a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh pakua a lal a, a nu chu Jerusalem chhuak Jehoadini a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa duhzâwng a ti ṭhîn; mahse, hreh tak chungin a ni a tih ṭhin ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lala a ṭhut ngheh veleh a pa thattute kha a that ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An fate erawh chu a khawih lo, Mosia Dân bu-a Lalpa thu, ‘Nu leh pate chu an fate sualna avânga tihhlum tûr an ni lo; fate pawh an pate sualna avânga tihhlum tûr an ni lo; anmahni sualna avâng chauhvin mi tihhlum tûr an ni,’ tih kha a zâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Amazia chuan Juda mite leh Benjamin mite chu a chi chiin sipai pâwl hrang hrangah a siam a; sâng rual te, za rual te hotu tûr a ruat thliah bawk a. Mipa kum sawmhnih chin chung lam chu an tel vek a ni, an vaiin nuaithum an tling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hêngho bâkah hmâr lam Israel-ho, mi nuai khat, tangkarua kg. sângthum leh zali bûk laiin a ruai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, lal hnênah chuan zâwlnei pakhat a lo kal a, “Israel sipaite hi hruai ve suh. Hêng Hmâr lam ram mite lamah hian Lalpa chu a ṭang lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Indonaah i chak phah i inbeisei a ni ang e. Indonaa chak leh chak loh hi Pathian thu thu a ni asin; hmêlmaten an hneh phah zâwk ang che,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amazia chuan zâwlnei hnênah, “Tangka ka pêk tawh zozai kha engtin nge ni ta ang?” a ti a. Zâwlnei chuan, “ Lalpa chuan a aia tam zâwk a pe leh thei che alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amazia chuan a sipai rawih, Efraim ram aṭanga lo kalte chu a bân a, a hawtîr ta a; Juda-ho chunga thinrim engphiarin an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amazia chuan huphurh lo deuhvin a sipaite chu Chi Ruamah a kalpui a. Edom sipaite nên chuan an inbei a, mi sîngkhat an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi sîngkhat an man bawk a; Sela khaw khâm kovah chuan an hruai a, an nam thla a, an tlahlum ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amazian indonaa kal ve a phal loh sipai a tirh hâwnte khân Samaria leh Beth-horon inkâra Juda khawpuite chu an bei a, mi sângthum zet an that a, râllâk sum tam tak an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amazian Edom-ho a hneh a, a lo haw chuan, an milemte a rawn hâwn a, a dahna a siam a, chibai a bûk a, an hmaah rimtui a hâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hei vâng hian Lalpa chu a thinur a, Amazia hnênah zâwlnei a tîr a. Zâwlnei chuan, “I laka an mite pawh chhan thei hlei lo hnam dang pathiante chu engtizia nge i biak tâk mai?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Engtik lai khân nge lal thurâwntu atân ka ruat che le? Ngawi mai rawh, ka that mai tûr che a nia,” a ti a. Zâwlnei chuan, “Ka thurâwn ngaithla lova hêng hi i tih avângin Pathianin tihboral che a tum tih ka hre ta,” a ti a, a ngawihsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judai lal Amazia leh a upate chuan Israel beih an rawt a, Jehua fapa, Jehoahaza fa Israel lal Jehoasa hnênah, “Pa leh pa, i han inbei teh ang,” tia cho tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoasa chuan hetiang hian a chhâng a, “ ‘Vawi khat chu Lebanon tlânga lenhlîng hian Lebanon sidar thing hnênah, ‘ka fapa nupuiah i fanu min pe rawh,’ a ti a. Ramsa veivâkin lenhlîng chu a pal thlu ta mai a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amazia, Edom mite i zu hneh hi i chhuang a nih vei hi; inah tawm hle hle mai rawh. Nang leh i mite tâna pawi tûr thil chawkchhuak mah ta che,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amazia chuan a thu chu a pawisa lo va, Edom mite pathian lem a biak avângin Pathianin Israel-ho kuta pêk a lo tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel lal Jehoasa leh Juda lal Amazia chu inbei tûrin an thawkchhuak a; Judai ram Beth-semes khaw bulah an inbei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda sipaite chu an chak lo ta zâwk a, mahni in lam panin an tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel lal Jehoasa chuan Juda lal Amazia, Joasa fapa, Ahazia tupa chu a man a, Jerusalem-ah a hruai a; khawpui kulh bang chu ‘Efraim kawngkhâr aṭanga bangkil kawngkhâr’ an tih thlengin kulh bang tawng zali chu a ṭhiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Râllâk sumah Tempula rangkachak leh tangkaruate, Obed-edoma thlahten an vên ṭhin Tempul bungbêl leh lal ina sum dah ṭhatte chu a hâwn a, dahkhama hrên tûr mi a hruai hâwng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Juda lal Amazia chu Israel lal Jehoasa ai chuan kum sâwm leh pangain a dam rei zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lal tirh aṭanga a lal tâwp thlenga Amazia thil tihte chu ‘Israel leh Juda lalte chanchin’ tih ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa laka a hel chinah kha chuan amah thah tum Jerusalem khaw mi an awm zeuh zeuh reng a ni. A tâwpah phei chuan Lakis khuaah a tlân a; mahse, a hmêlmate chuan an ûmzui a, an va that ta tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A ruang chu sakawr an phurhtîr a, Davida khawpuiah lal thlânah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai ram mi zawng zawng chuan kum sâwm leh paruka upa Amazia fapa Uzia chu a pa aiawha lal tûrin an thlang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amazia thih hnuin Uzia hian Elat khua hi a la lêt leh a, Judai ram a belhin a din ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzia chu kum sâwm leh paruk a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh pahnih a lal a. A nu chu Jerusalem mi Jekoli a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amazia angin Lalpa lawmzâwng a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian thu lama kaihruaitu Zekaria dam chhûng chuan Lalpa chu a pawm tlat a, Pathian pawhin a tihmuingîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzia chuan Filistia-ho chu a rûn a, Gath khaw kulh bang te, Jabne leh Asdod kulh bang te pawh a tichhia a; Askelon bulah leh Filistia ram hmun hrang hrangah kulh a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian chuan Filistia mi te, Gurbaal-a awm Arab-ho te leh Meun-ho te chu a hnehpui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amon-ho pawhin Uzia hnênah chhiah an chawi a; a lo ropui a, Aigupta ram thlengin a hming a thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem kulh bang chu a thuam thar bawk a; ‘Bangkil kawngkhâr’ an tihah te, ‘Ruam kawngkhâr’ an tihah te, kulh kawina lai kawngkhârah te in sâng a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram palailêngah te pawh kulh nei khua a din a; tui a lai chhuak thluah bawk a ni; khawthlang lam, tlang ṭhut phairuamah bâwng a vulh ṭeuh bawk a. Lo neih lamah a tui hle a, tlângramah pawh grepte a phuntîr a, phai ram ṭhate chu leiletah a neihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sipai tam tak, indo thei mai a nei reng a. An chanchin ziakna chu ziaktu Jeiela leh Maaseian, lal milian Hanania hovin an vawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hotu sânghnih leh zarukin a sipaite chu an ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An hnuaiah chuan sipai chak tak, râl bei mai thei nuaithum leh sângsarih leh zanga a nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Uzia chuan a sipaite chu phaw te, fei te, thîrlukhum te, thîrkawr te, thal te, virvawma hman tûr lungte mûm te a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah chuan a mi themthiamte siam thal kahna khâwl te, lung lian pui pui vawmna tûr khâwl te, in sângah te leh kulh kilah te a bun a. A hming pawh a thang thui ta hle a. Pathianin a ṭanpui avânga chuti taka ropui chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal Uzia chu a ropui tâk hle hnu chuan a lo chapo ta deuh va, chu chu a chhiat phah ta a ni.A Pathian, Lalpa thu pawisa lovin rimtui hâlna dawhkâna rimtui hâl tûrin Tempulah a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puithiam chak leh huaisen tak tak sawmriatin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />khap tumin an zui a, “Uzia, Lalpa hnêna rimtui i hâl a thiang lo. Puithiam atâna serh hran Arona thlahte chauhvin hetiang thil hi an ti tûr a ni. He Hmun Thianghlim hi chhuahsan rawh, Lalpa chu i tithinur a, a duhsakna i dawng tawh chuang lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uzia chu Tempul chhûng rimtui hâlna dawhkân bulah chuan a ding a, rimtui hâlna bûr chu a keng a, puithiamho chungah chuan a thinur hle a; mahse, an hmaah ngei, Lalpa in chhûnga rimtui hâlna dawhkân bulah chuan a chalah pânchhia a kai ta thut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azaria leh puithiamte chuan lal chal an en chuan an phâwk ta hru vek a, Tempul chhûng ata chu an hnawt chhuak ta a. Lalpa chuan a hrem tâk avângin hmanhmawh takin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A natna avâng chuan lal Uzia chu a dam chhûng chuan a bawlhhlawh ta a, Tempula a luh thian tak loh avângin ama inah a awm ta reng a, a hna a thawk tawh lo, a fapa Jothaman ram a awp ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lal chhûnga Uzia thiltih zawng zawng chu zâwlnei Isaian a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Uzia chu a thi a, lalho thlânmualah an phûm a, a pân vei avâng chuan lalho thlânah an dah duh lo. A fapa Jothama chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jothama chu kum sawmhnih leh panga a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh paruk a lal a. A nu chu Zadoka fanu Jerusaii a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pa ang bawkin Lalpa lawmzâwng a ti ṭhîn; a pain Tempul chhûnga rimtui a hâl ang kha chuan a ti ve lo. Mipuite erawh chu an sual ngaiin an sual reng mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tempul hmâr lam kawngka hi Jothama siam a ni, khaw kulh bang pawh a siam ṭha tam khawp mai; ‘Ofel’ an tih hmun phei chu a chei nasa hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judai ram chhûngah khuate a siam a, ngawah te kulh leh râlvênbûk te a siam thluah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amon lal nên an inbei a; a tudawl a, tangkarua kg. sângthum leh zali, huit quintal sîngkhat, barli quintal sîngkhat, kum thum chhûng kum tin chhiah a chawitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jothama chuan Lalpa , a Pathian thu a awih avângin a ropui ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jothama lal laia thil thleng chanchin - an indo thute leh a thiltih dangte chu, ‘Israel leh Juda lalte chanchin’ ziakna bu-ah a chuang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jothama chu kum sawmhnih leh panga a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh paruk a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, a fapa Ahaza chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaza chu kum sawmhnih a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh paruk a lal a. A pu Davida tih dân ang zâwm duh lovin Lalpa duh loh zâwng a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel lalte tih dân a la a, Baal lim a chhûntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinom ruamah rimtui a hâl a, Israel mite hmaa Lalpa hnawh chhuah hnam dang tih dân tenawm tak takte chu a chîng ve a, a fapate ngei pawh milem hmaah hâlral thilhlan atân a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlânga hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângah te, thingbuk ṭha deuh hlim hnuaiah te Ahaza chu a inthawi ṭhîn a, rimtuite a hâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahaza chuan thil sual a tih avângin Suria lal kutah Lalpa , Pathian chuan a pe a; Damaska khuaah Juda mi tam tak Suria lal chuan a hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel lal Remalia fapa Peka pawhin Ahaza chu a bei a, a hneh a, Juda sipai huai ṭha ṭha mi nuaikhat leh sînghnih a that a. Judai ram mite chuan an thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu an kalsan avângin Lalpa chuan chûng thil chu an chungah a thlentîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel sipai Efraim pasalṭha Zikria chuan Ahaza fapa Maaseia chu a that a, lal in enkawltu Azrikama a that bawk a; lal dawttu Elkana pawh a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda-te chu an unaute an ni na a, Israel sipaite chuan hmeichhia leh naupang nuaihnih salah an man a. Samaria khuaah an khalh khâwm a, râllâk sum tam tak an hâwn bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samaria khuaah chuan Lalpa zâwlnei pakhat Odeda a awm a, Israel sipai ruala Judai rama an sal mante Samaria khua an lût tûr chu a lo hmu a, an hnênah, “In thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu Juda-ho chungah a thinur a, a hnehtîr ta che u a ni; mahse, in that a, an chunga in nun a râwn lutukzia a hmu reng asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem leh Judai rama awm mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh bawiha siam in tum leh zêl a nih hi. Nangni pawhin Lalpa , in Pathian lakah thil sual in ti tih in hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thu hi ngaithla teh u, hêng in sal mante hi in unau, in farnute an ni asin; chhuah vek rawh u, chutilo chu Lalpa a thinur ang a, a sawisa ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmâr lam lalrama hotu lian, Jehohanana fapa Azaria te, Mesilemota fapa Berekia te, Saluma fapa Zehiskia te, Hadlaia fapa Amasa te pawhin sipaiho thiltih chu ṭha an ti lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An hnênah, “In sal mante hetah han hruai suh u, Lalpa lakah thil sual kan ti dêr tawh a, min hrem duh hial khawpin kan tithinur a ni. Kan thil sual tih tawh bâkah la tih belh leh zêl in tum em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, sipaite chuan an sal man leh râllâk sum an hawnte chu mipui leh an hotute kutah an hlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng hming sawi tâkte chu an râllâk sum aṭanga sal an mante hnêna thawmhnaw pe tûrin an ruat a. Silhfên te, pheikhawk bun tûr te an pe a; an hliam chulh tûr oliv hriak an sem bawk a. Mahni kea kal thei lo khawpa chaute chu sabengtung chungah an chuantîr a; an sal man zawng zawng chu Judai ram Jeriko, tûm khua an tihah chuan an hruai kîr leh ta vek a. Tin, Israel-ho chu Samaria lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan lal Ahaza chuan amah ṭanpui tûrin Asuria lalte a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Edom-hovin Judai ram an rawn rûn a, an hneh a, mi tam tak an man a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Filistia-ho lahin thlang lam tlâng ṭhut phai khua te leh Judai ram Negeb te an rawn bei bawk a. Anni phei chuan Beth-semes te, Aijalon te, Gederot te, Soko leh a chhehvêl khua te, Timna leh a chhehvêl khua te, Gimzo leh a chhehvêl khua te an la a, an luah ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda lal Ahaza chuan a mite ṭhatna tûr a ngaihtuah miah lo va, Lalpa chu a pawisak dêr loh avângin Juda-ho chu a titlâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asuria lal Tiglat-Pilesera chuan Ahaza chu puih ahnêkin harsatna a siamsak ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahaza chuan Tempula rangkachak te, lal ina mite leh mi hausa deuh ina mi te chu a la a, Asuria lal chu a pe a; mahse, a sâwt lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mangan vânglai tak pawh chuan Ahaza chu Lalpa lakah a sual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah hnehtu Suria-ho pathiante chu chibai a bûk ve ta mai a, ‘Suria pathiante hian Suria lal an ṭanpui a; chuvângin, an hnênah thilhlan hlân ila min pui ve ngei ang,’ a ti a ni. Chu chu a mite nên chuan chhiat zual phah sauhna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûng bâkah, Tempula hmanrua a la chhuak a, a tichhia a. Tempul chu a khâr a; Jerusalem khuaah maichâm a siam thliah thluah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judai ram khawpuiah leh khuaahte chuan hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsâng, rimtui hâlna tûr a siam fer fur a. Hetiang hian a thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu a tithinur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A rorêl chhûng chanchin dangte chu a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin ‘Juda leh Israel lalte chanchin’ ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahaza chu a thi a, lal thlânah ni lo, Jerusalem-ah an phûm a, a fapa Hezekia chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekia chu kum sawmhnih leh panga a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh pakua a lal a. A nu chu Zekaria fanu Abijai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pu Davida angin Lalpa lâwmzâwng a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lal tirh kum, thla hmasa berah Hezekia chuan Tempul kawngkhârte chu a hawng leh a, a chhiate chu a siam ṭhattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tempul khawchhak lam tualah chuan puithiamte leh Levia chite chu a ko khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an hnênah, “Nangni Levia chite u, inthian thianghlim ula, in pate Pathian, Lalpa in hi thian thianghlim rawh u; Tempul aṭang hian thil bawlhhlawh zawng zawng paih chhuak vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan pate chu Lalpa , kan Pathian lakah an rinawm lo va, a duh loh zâwng an ti a. An helsan a, a awmna in chu hawisanin an hnuchhawn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tempul kawngkhâr chu an kalh a, khâwnvâr an timit a, rimtui an hâl lo va, Hmun Thianghlimah Israel-te Pathian tân hâlral thilhlan an hlân hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hei vâng hian Lalpa chu Juda leh Jerusalem mite chungah a thinur a, mi tin mak tih leh chekkhum hial khawpin a sawisa ta a ni; chu chu nangni pawhin in hmu reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan pate chu khandaiha sah hlum an ni a, kan fanu kan fapa, kan nupuite nên salah an man kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan chunga a thinur hi a tihkian beiseiin Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa nên thu thlun ka tum ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka fate u, awm mai mai teh suh u, Lalpa chuan a hmaa dinga, a rawngbâwl atân a thlang che u a; chuvângin, a rawng bâwl ula, thilhlante hlân rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chûng zîngah chuan Levia chi hêngte hi an tel: Kohata thlahte zînga mi Amasaia fapa Mahata leh Azaria fapa Joela. Meraria thlah zînga mi Abdia fapa Kisa leh Jahalelela fapa Azaria; Gersona thlahte zînga mi Zima fapa Joa leh Joa fapa Edena.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elizafana thlah zînga mi Simria leh Jeuela; Asafa thlah zînga mi Zekaria leh Matania;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hemana thlah zînga mi Jehuela leh Simeia; Jeduthuna thlah zînga mi Semaia leh Uziela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêng mite hian an chipui Levia chite chu an pun khâwm a, an inthian thianghlim a; lal thupêk ang chuan Tempul chu an thian a. Lalpa Dân bu-a sawi angin an thian fai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Tempul chhûngah puithiamho chu an lût a, thil bawlhhlawh an hmuh rêng rêng chu Lalpa in tualah chuan an rawn dah chhuak a; Levia chite chuan chûng chu Kidron luiah an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thla khatna, ni hmasa berah Tempul chu an thian ṭan a, ni riat ni chuan Tempul pindan hmasa thlengin an thian zo va. Ni riat dang, ni sâwm leh paruk thlengin Tempul chhûng chu Pathian biakna tlâk tûrin an thian leh a, an tithianghlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levia chite chu lal Hezekia hnênah an kal a, “Tempul chhûng chu kan thian thianghlim ta. Hâlral thilhlan hâlna maichâm te, chhang serh dahna dawhkân te leh hmanrua zawng zawng pawh kan tithianghlim ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahazan Lalpa laka suahsual a bâwl laia Tempul bungbêl a lâk chhuahte kha kan dah kîr a, kan tithianghlim vek tawh a, Lalpa maichâm bulah engkim dah fel a ni tawh,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chuan Jerusalem-a hotu deuh deuh chu a ko khâwm rum rum a, Lalpa Tempulah chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bâwngpa pasarih, berâmchal pasarih, berâmno pasarih leh sual thawina thilhlanah kêlpa pasarih an rawn dah a; Arona thlah puithiamte chu Lalpa maichâma hlân tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bâwngte chu an talh a, an thisen chu maichâmah an theh a, berâmte pawh chu an talh a, an thisen chu maichâmah an theh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal leh pungkhâwmho hmaah chuan sual thawina thilhlan atân kêlpate chu an rawn kai a, an lu-ah an kut an nghat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Puithiamte chuan an talh a, an thisen chu sual thawi nân an hlân a, Israel mi zawng zawng sual thawi nân an hlân a ni. Lal thu angin hâlral thilhlan leh sual thawina thilhlan chu Israel mi zawng zawng tân an hlân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal zâwlnei Gada leh zâwlnei Nathana hmanga Davida hnêna Lalpa sawi ang khân Levia chite chu perhkhuang te, dârbenthek leh ṭingṭang te nên Tempulah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Davida tum ṭhin ang thiltum chite an keng bawk a. Puithiamte pawh tawtawrâwt kengin an ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chuan hâlral thilhlan chu hlân tawh tûrin a hrilh a; an han hlan chuan mipuiin Lalpa fak hla an sa a, tawtawrâwt te an hâm a, tum rîk chi dangte pawh chu an tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuta awm apiang chuan Pathian chibai an bûk a, hla an sa a, an thilhlan a kan zawh hma chu rimawi an tum zui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal Hezekia leh mipuite chu an ṭhingṭhi a, Pathian chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lal leh hotute chuan Davida leh zâwlnei Asafa hla phuah, Lalpa fakna hla kha, Levia chite chu an saktîr a. Ṭhingṭhia Pathian chibai bûkin an za chuan hlim takin an awm zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekia chuan mipui hnênah, “ Lalpa tân in inthian thianghlim ta bawk a; thilhlan te, lâwmthu sawina te Lalpa Tempulah han la rawh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pungkhâwmho chuan thilhlan te, lâwmthu sawina te an rawn hlân a, a duh apiangin hâlral thilhlan tûr te an rawn keng bawk a. Pungkhâwmhovin hâlral thilhlan tûr an rawn lâkte chu bâwngpa sawmsarih, berâmno zahnih leh berâm za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bâwng zaruk leh berâm sângthum pawh thilhlan chi dangah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A talhtu tûr puithiam an indaih loh avângin an talh zawh hma chu Levia chiten an pui a. A tâwp lamah chuan puithiam tam zâwk pawh an inthian thianghlim hman a; Levia chite hi puithiamho ai chuan an lo invawng thianghlim thei zâwk a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mipui thilhlan hâl hi puithiam tih tûr a ni a. An ran talh mipui ei thaute pawh an hâl tûr a ni; hâlral thilhlan ruala uain an rawn hlante pawh puithiamin an bun chhuak tûr a ni. Tichuan, Tempul rawngbâwlna chu an ṭan leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lal Hezekia leh mipuite chu Pathianin hetianga ti leh thei mai tûra a ṭanpui avângin an hlim ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiam tam tak an inthian thianghlim hman lo va, mipui lah Jerusalem-ah an pung khâwm hman hek lo; chuvângin, Kalhlên Kût chu a hun takah an hmang thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Hezekia leh a hote leh Jerusalem mite chu an inrâwn khâwm a, Kalhlên Kût chu a thla hnihnaah hman an rêl ta a. Lal chuan Israel ram leh Judai ramah thu a thawn darh ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Efraim leh Manase-ho te phei chu Jerusalem Tempula lo kala, Lalpa chawimawia Kalhlên kût hmang tûrin lehkhain a sâwm nghe nghe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal leh mipuite chuan an thil rawt chu tifuh an inti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmâr lam, Dan aṭanga chhim lam Beer-seba inkâra Israel mi zawng zawng chu Jerusalem-ah a tam thei ang ber lo kala, Kalhlên kût rawn hmang tûrin an sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal leh a hote chuan Judai ram leh Israel ramah lamkal an tlântîr a, ngenna lehkha hetiang hi an thawn darh a: “Israel mite u, Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te Pathian, Lalpa lam hi hawi teh u; keini, Asuria kut tuar lova, nungdama la awmte lam hi a lo hawi ve dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In pate leh in unau te, in thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa laka an che khawlo ang khân che ve suh u, in hmuh angin a hrem nat êm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anni angin luhlul suh u, Lalpa thu chu zâwm zâwk rawh u. In Pathian Lalpa tihthianghlim tawh Jerusalem-a a Tempulah hian lo kal ula; hetah hian amah chu chibai han bûk rawh u, in laka a thinur a reh dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa lam in lo hawi phawt chuan in hmêlmaten sala an man in lainate kha an lo khawngaih ang a, an rawn hâwntîr ngei ang. Lalpa , in Pathian hi Pathian ngilnei a ni asin, a lam in lo hawi chuan a hawisan tawp lo vang che u,” tiin an ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An mi tirhte chu Efraim leh Manasea thlahte awmna ram khaw tinah an kal a, Zebulun ram pawh an thleng a; mahse, mite chuan an lo nuihsawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuti chung pawh chuan Aser-ho te, Manase-ho te, Zebulun-ho te Jerusalem-a lo kal duh an awm nual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judai ramah pawh Pathian chuan hna a thawk a, lal leh a hote thu angin lungrual taka Pathian duhzâwng tih an châk ta hle hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thla hnihnaah chuan chhang dawidim telh loh kût hmang tûrin Jerusalem khuaah chuan mi tam tak an lo kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem-a pathian dang biakna maichâm awm zawng zawng, rimtui an hâlna maichâmte nên an la a, Kidron luiah an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sâwm leh pali ni chuan Kalhlên kûta thilhlan berâmno chu an talh a. Puithiam leh Levia chi te pawh kha, an zah êm êm avângin Lalpa tân an lo inthian thianghlim fel vek tawh a, hâlral thilhlan pawh Tempulah an hlân ve thei tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian mi Mosia Dân bu-a sawi ang khân an awmna tûr hmun ruatah an awm ṭhap a. Levia chite chuan thilhlan thisen chu puithiamho an pe a, anni chuan maichâmah an lo theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tam tak chu an bawlhhlawh avângin Kalhlên kût berâmno an talh a thiang lo va, Levia chite khân an talhsak a, Lalpa hnênah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Efraim-ho te, Manase-ho te, Isakar-ho te, Zebulun-ho te zînga mi tam tak phei chu an inthen thianghlim loh avângin dân ang lovin Kalhlên kût chu an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chu chûngho tân chuan a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , min thlahtute Pathian, bawlhhlawh kai an ni chung pawhin thinlung taka chibai bûktu che chu i ṭhat avângin ngaidam ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Hezekia ṭawngṭai chu a ngaithla a, mite chu a ngaidam a, engtin mah a khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlim takin ni sarih chhûng chu Jerusalem-a lo kalte chuan chhang dawidim telh loh kût chu an hmang a, ni tin mai Levia chite leh puithiamte chuan awrâwl tâwp chhuahin Lalpa fak hla an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa biaknaa an tumrîk neihte nên inkhâwm kaihhruai an thiam êm avâng chuan Levia chite chu lal Hezekia chuan a fak a. An thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu an fak a, remna thilhlante hlânin ni sarih kût ruai an ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mipui chuan ni sarih dang kût nawn an rawt a; tichuan, hlim takin ni sarih an kût leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chuan bâwngpa sângkhat leh berâm sângsarih, mipui thilhlana ruai ṭheh nân a thawh a, an hotute chuan bâwngpa sângkhat leh berâm sîngkhat an thawh bawk a. Puithiam tam tak an lo inthian thianghlim tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judai rama mi lo pung khâwm te, Levia chi te, puithiam te, Israel ram aṭanga lo kal te, Judai ram leh Israel rama hnam dang chêng lo kal vete nên an vaiin an hlim êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaah chuan mi tin an lâwm a, Davida fapa Solomona thih hnuah chutiang khawpa hlimna a la awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Levia chite leh puithiamte chuan mipui tân malsâwmna an sawi a, Lalpa chuan a lo ngaithla a, an ṭawngṭaina chuan Hmun Thianghlim vân a thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kût an ṭiak chuan Israel mi zawng zawng chu Judai ram khaw tinah an kal darh a, an lungphun te, an pathiannu Aseri lim an phun te chu an nam tlu a, maichâmte leh hmunsâng, hnam dang pathian an biakna hmunte chu an tichim a. Judai ram bâkah Benjamin te, Efraim te leh Manase biala mi te pawh an tichhia a, mahni in lamah an haw leh ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chuan puithiam te leh Levia chi te chu hna an insem thliah ṭhîn ang khân an thawh dân tûr a remfelsak leh a. An hna tûr chu hâlral thilhlan hlan te, remna thilhlan hlan te, Tempula Pathian biak hruai te, Tempul kawngkhâr bula Lalpa fak hla saa lâwmthu sawi te a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hezekia chuan ama bâwng leh berâm rual aṭangin tûk tin zan tin hâlral thilhlan tûr te, sabat ni te, thla thar ni te leh kût huna hâlral thilhlan Lalpa dân bu-a hlan tûr tih te chu a tum vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa Dânin a phût ang chuan, an hun zawng zawng an hman theih nân, puithiamte leh Levia chite chanvo thilhlan chu pe ṭhîn tûrin Jerusalem mite chu Hezekia chuan a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutianga thu a pêk veleh Israel mite chuan an thilpêk chhangphut ṭha chi te, uain te, oliv hriak te, khawizu te leh an thil thar te leh an neih apiang an sâwma pakhat nên an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judai ram khawpuia awm zawng zawng chuan an ran sâwma pakhat te, an Pathian, Lalpa hnênah thil tam tak an pêkte chu an rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thla thumna aṭangin an rawn pe ṭan a, thla sarihna thlengin an rawn pêk chu a vûm thûr mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Hezekia leh hruaituten thilpêk tling khâwm tamzia an hmuh chuan Lalpa an chawimawi a. Israel mipuite pawh an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal chuan puithiamte leh Levia chite hnênah thilpêk tling khâwm chu an khawpkham leh kham loh a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zadoka thlaha puithiam lalber Azaria chuan, “Miten an thilpêkte Tempula an rawn ken tâk hnu hi chuan ei tûr kan nei ta a, ei sên loh tam tak a bâng bawk a ni. Lalpa chuan a mite mal a sâwm a, hetiang hi kan nei thei ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal thupêk angin Tempul ram chhûngah chuan kudâm an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An thilpêk leh sâwma pakhat chu a bothlau loh nân an dah ṭha a. A enkawl tûrin Levia chi Konania an ruat a, a nau Simeian a ṭanpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An kaihhruaia thawk tûrin Levia chi Jehiela te, Azazia te, Nahata te, Asahela te, Jerimota te, Jozabada te, Eliela te, Ismakia te, Mahata te, Benaia te chu lal Hezekia leh puithiam lalber Azaria chuan an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Imna fapa Korea, Tempul khawchhak lam kawngka vêngtu hotu chu Lalpa hnênah anmahni duh thua thilhlan leh thil serh hran bîkte dawnga sem ṭhîn tûrin an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khaw dang, puithiam awmnaah chuan hêng Levia chi Edena te, Miniamina te, Jesua te, Semaia te, Amaria te, Sekania te chuan ei tûr chu ṭha takin an sempui a, an Levia chipuite pawh, a pawimawh leh pawimawh lo deuh sawi lovin an sem thliah thliah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipa, kum sawmthum chung lam, Tempula rawngbâwl theite chuan an dinhmun azirin an dawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puithiamho chu a chi chia inchhâwk tûr hna an sem a; Levia chi kum sawmhnih chung lamte erawh chu a pâwl pâwlin hna thawk tûrin an ruat ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An hming chu an nupui te, an fate leh an awmpui nghette nên an ziak vek a, eng lai pawha an hna thawk tûrin koh mai theih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Arona thlahte awmna tûr, thingtlâng khua leh a chhehvêl ran tlatna ram ruata awm puithiamte hnêna ei leh bar tûr semtu tûr an ruat bawk a, Levia chi chhiarnaa hming chuangte pawh an pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judai ram pumah lal Hezekia chuan a Pathian, Lalpa hmuha ṭha leh dik chu rinawm takin a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tihtakzetin a Pathian rawng a bâwl a, Tempul a ngaihsaka, dânte a zawm êm avângin, kawng engkimah a hmuingîl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekia chuan Lalpa rawng ṭha takin a bâwl tâk hnu chuan Asuria lal Senakeriba chuan Judai ram a rawn rûn a. Kulh nei khuate chu a sipaite chuan an hual a, kulh bangte chu a tihchhiattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekia chuan Jerusalem pawh rawn beih zêl a tum tih a hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a hote nên an inrâwn tlâng a, Asuria-hovin Jerusalem an rawn hnaih hnua tui in tûr an neih loh nân khaw pâwn hnaia tuikhur zawng zawng chu hnawh zai an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hotute chuan mi tam tak an hruai a, tuikhur zawng zawng chu luang chhuak tûr awm lovin an hnawh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chuan khaw kulh bang derdêp laite chu a thuam ṭha a, in sângte a sak belh a, Jerusalem khaw hlui Milo an tih, lei an chhûn khahna lai kulh bangte pawh chu a siam ṭha a. Fei leh phaw tam tak a siamtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khaw mite chu sipai hotuten an ho va, khawpui luhna kawngkhâr tualzâwl zau laiah chuan mite chu an rawn hruai khâwm a, a lo fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Huai takin awm ula, ṭan la sauh sauh rawh u: Asuria leh a sipai zozaite hi hlau suh ula, zâm hek suh u, an aia ropui kan zîngah a awm a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ani zawng mihring chaknaah a innghat a, keini zawng Lalpa , kan Pathianin min pui dâwn a, râl chu min dosak dâwn a ni,” a ti a. Mipui chu Juda lal Hezekia thu avâng chuan an thlamuang ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Senakeriba leh a sipaite Lakis khuaa an awm hnu chuan Hezekia leh Judai ram mi, Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawngte hnênah chuan palai a rawn tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Asuria lal Senakeriba chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Eng nge maw in beiseia, Jerusalem hual in tuar dâwn le? Lalpa , kan Pathian chuan Asuria lal kut ata min chhan dâwn’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hezekia hian tuihâl leh rilṭâma thi tûrin a bum che u elo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In Pathian biakna hmunsângte leh maichâmte ṭhiatin Jerusalem leh Judai ram mite chu, ‘maichâm pakhatah Pathian chu chibai in bûk ang a, chutah chuan thil in hlân tûr a ni,’ titu kha he Hezekia hi a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei leh ka pate chuan ram tina hnam tinrêng kan sawisak ṭhin dân kha in hria em? Chûngho pathiante chuan an mite chu kan kut aṭangin an chhan thei ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pa chuan chûngho pathiante chu a titlâwm vek a, Pathian pawh hian a kut ata a chhan che uin in ring elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, Hezekia hian bum che u suh se, bual â che u hek suh sela, a thu ring suh u. Asuria lal laka a betute chhan theitu hnam pathian pakhat mah an awm lo. In Pathian pawh hian a va chhan rua lo che u êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asuria sipai hotu chuan Lalpa , Pathian leh a chhiahhlawh Hezekia chu a sâwt lehzual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asuria lal chuan a lehkhaah chuan Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chu thamlo takin, “Hnam dang pathiante pawh ka kut ata an mite chhan thei rêng an awm lo, Hezekia Pathian pawhin a mite chu ka lakah a chhan thei bîk dâwn em ni?” tiin a ziak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khaw lâk a awlsam zâwk beiseiin Jerusalem kulh bula awmte tihzâm a tum a, Hebrai ṭawngin thu a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem Pathian chu hnam dang pathian, mihring siam ang lekin a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal Hezekia leh Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia chu an ṭawngṭai a, Pathian an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a, Asuria sipaite leh an hotute chu an riahhmunah chuan a rawn tihlum a. Asuria lal chu mualpho takin an khaw lamah a haw ta a. Ni khat chu an pathian biak ina a awm laiin a fate zînga mi ngeiin khandaihin an sât hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal Hezekia leh Jerusalem mite chu chutiang chuan Asuria lal Senakeriba leh an hmêlmate kut ata Lalpa chuan a chhan chhuak a. An chhehvêl ramte nên inrem ṭha takin a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna thilhlan hlân tûrin Jerusalem-ah mi tam tak an lo kal a. Hezekia hnênah pawh thilpêk an rawn pe zut zut a, hnam tinin Hezekia chu an ngaisâng hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hetih hun lai vêl hian Hezekia chu thih ngamin a na a. A ṭawngṭai a, a dam leh tûr thu chhinchhiahna Lalpa chuan a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa thiltihsak avâng chuan lâwm nachâng a hre lo va, a chapo avâng chuan Judai ram leh Jerusalem chuan an tuar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tâwpah erawh zawng Hezekia leh Jerusalem mite chu an inchhîr a, an inngaitlâwm a, Hezekia dam chhûng chuan Lalpa thinurna chu an chungah a thleng ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chu a hausa ta hle a, tu pawhin an ngaisâng a, a rangkachak te, tangkarua te, lungmantam te, thil rimtui te, phaw te leh thil dang hlu tak tak te dahna tûr in te a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A buh te, uain te, oliv hriak te dahna tûr chhêk in a saktîr a; bâwng in te, berâm huangte a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêng bâkah hian Pathianin berâm te, sum leh pai chi tinrêng a pe a, khua te a siam thluah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekia hian Gihon tuiluanna chhakta zâwk chu a tiping a, tui kawng a siam a, Jerusalem khaw chhûng thlang lam pangah a luan luhtîr a ni. Hezekia chu a thil tih engkimah a hmuingîl zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A chunga thil mak thleng zâwt fiah tûrin Babulon lalin palai a rawn tirh lai kha chuan mi eng ang nge a nih fiah nân Pathianin a thlahfâl a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lal Hezekia thil tih dang te, a thil tih ṭhat te chu, Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabu-ah leh Israel leh Judai lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hezekia chu a thi a, lal thlânmual chuanchungah an phûm a. A thih chuan Judai ram leh Jerusalem-in an chawimawi nasa hle a. A fapa Manasea chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pahnih a nihin Manasea chu Judai ramah a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh panga a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israela thlahte hmaa Lalpan a hnawh chhuah hnamte thil tenawm tak an tih ang chu a ti ve ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pain a tihchhiat, hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângte kha a siam ṭha leh a. Baal hnêna inthawina hlanna tûr maichâmte a siam a, pathiannu Aseri lim te a siam a, arsi te chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumkhuaa Lalpa biakna tûr Tempul a ruatah chuan hnam dang pathian maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempul pindan pahnihah chuan arsi biakna tûr maichâm te a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinom ruamah hâlral thilhlanah a fapa te a hlân a; aien te, kutze en te, arsi biak te a chîng a, mitthi thlûk thiam te, aisân chîng te a râwn ṭhîn a. Lalpa ṭha tih loh zâwng a ti a, a tithinur ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A milem chhûn chu tempulah a dah a, Pathianin Davida leh Solomona hnênah, “Israel hnam zawng zawng ram zîngah Jerusalem leh he in hi ka hming lamna hmun tûra ka thlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumkhuaa ka thupêk zawng zawng an zawma, ka thuruatte leh ka dânte, ka chhiahhlawh Mosian a hrilhte kha an zawm chuan Israel-ho hi engtikah mah an pate hnêna ka pêk tawh ram aṭang hian ka hnawt chhuak lo vang,” a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasea chuan Judai ram leh Jerusalem mite chu thil dik lo a tihtîr a, Israel-te hmaa a hnawh chhuah hnamte tih ṭhin aia sual nasa zâwk an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Manasea leh a mite hnênah chuan thu a sawi ṭhîn a, an ngaithla duh si lo va. Chuvâng chuan Asuria sipai hotute chu Lalpa chuan Judai ram chu a rûntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Manasea chu an man a, khaidiatin an hlîng a, a hnârah thîr kawm an vuah a, Babulon-ah an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mangan êm avâng chuan Lalpa a Pathian hmaah chuan nasa takin a intitlâwm a, ṭanpui a dîl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Manasea ṭawngṭai chu a lo ngaihthlâksak ta a, a dîlna chu chhângin Jerusalem-ah a hâwntîr leh ta a. Manasea chuan Lalpa chu Pathian a lo ni ngei tih a hre chiang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Davida khawpui, khawchhak lam panga kulh bang pâwn zâwk chu Manasea chuan a zawm sâng a, Gihon tui awmna ruam hmâr lam Sangha Kawngkhâr bul ‘Ofel’ an tih hmun thlengin a siam a. Judai rama kulh nei khaw tinah sipai pâwl khat, hotu pakhat nên a dah vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam dang pathian lem leh milim chhûn amahin Tempula a dahte chu a paih bo va. Tempul mual leh Jerusalem khuaa hnam dang pathian biakna maichâm awmte pawh chu a la a, khawpui ata a paih chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa biakna maichâm chu a siam ṭha a, remna thilhlan te, lâwmthu sawina thilhlan te a hlân a, Judai ram mi zawng zawng chu Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa a biaktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipuite chu an inthawina hmun pangngaiah la inthawi reng mah se, Lalpa hnênah chauh an inthawi ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasea thil tih dang zawng zawng, Pathian hnêna a ṭawngṭaina te, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hminga zâwlneiten a hnêna thu an sawi te chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Manasea ṭawngṭaina leh Pathian chhânna te, a sim hmaa thil sual a tih chanchin te, hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsâng te siama, Aseri lim siama, a milem chhûn a biak thu te, zâwlneiho chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang vek bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Manasea chu a thi a, lal inah an phûm a, a fapa Amona chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amona chu kum sawmhnih leh pahnih a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa Manasea ang bawkin Lalpa chungah thil sual a ti a, a pa milem chhûnte chu chibai a bûk ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pa ang khân a inngaitlâwm ve duh lo va, Lalpa lam a hawi duh hek lo, a pa ai mah khân a sual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hoten an phiar a, a inah an that a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judai ram mite chuan Amona thattute chu an that ve a, a fapa Josia chu lalah an siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum riat a nihin Josia chu Judai ramah a lal ṭan a, kum sawmthum leh pakhat Jerusalem-ah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa lawmzâwng a ti ṭhîn a, a thlahtu Davida awm dân angin a awm a. Pathian dânte chu uluk takin a zâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josia chuan kum riat a lal kumin, la naupang hle mah se, a thlahtu Davida Pathian chu a be ve ṭan ta a; kum li hnuah phei chuan hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsâng te, Aseri lim te leh milim dang te chu a tichhe vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thuin a hote chuan Baal biakna maichâmte chu an chhu chhia a, a bula rimtui hâlna maichâmte pawh an tichhia a; Aseri limte leh milim dangte chu an chhu dip vek a, chûng betute thlânah chuan an phul a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hnam dang puithiamho ruhte chu an pathian biakna maichâmah chuan an hâl a. Tichuan, Judai ram leh Jerusalem-ah khua chu an thian thianghlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Manase leh Efraim te, Simeon leh hmâr lama Naftali ram thlengin an khawpuia mi leh an khaw ram tawh hnua mite chu a thian fai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmâr lam bial Israel chhûnga maichâmte leh Aseri limte a tichhia a, milimte chu a chhu dip a, rimtui an hâlna maichâmte pawh chu a tichhe vek a, Jerusalem-ah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnam dang pathian biak a tihtâwpa, ram leh Tempul a tihthianghlim hnu kum sâwm leh pariat a lal kum chuan Josia chuan Tempul chhûng siam ṭha tûrin mi pathum, Azalia fapa Safana te, Jerusalem khaw awptu Maaseia te, Joahaza fapa hotu lal tak Joa te a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levia chi, kawngka vêngtuten Tempul sum tûr an khawn ṭhin kha puithiam lalber Hilkia hnênah an hlân zêl a. Efraim mi te, Manase mi te leh Israel hmâr lam ram mite hnên aṭang leh Judai ram te, Benjamin ram te leh Jerusalem mite hnên aṭangin an khawn ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He tangka hi, he mite pathum kutah hian an pe a, anni chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mistirite leh in sa mite kutah lung leh thing lei nân te, thil lo tlabal tawh, Juda lalten an lo ngaihsak loh, bangrel te, khanchhuk te siam ṭhat nân an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnathawktute chuan uluk takin hna an thawk a, Levia chi, mi pali Meraria thlah Jahata leh Obadia te, Kohata thlah Zekaria leh Mesulama te chuan an ho va. Hêng Levia chite hi thil tum thiam tak vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levia chia mi ṭhenkhat chuan thil thiartute an vêng a, hna hrang hrang thawktu an ho va. Ṭhenkhatin senso lam an lo chhinchhiah fel a, ṭhenkhatin vên hna an thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sum dahkhâwmna ata tangka an lâk chhuah chuan Lalpa dân bu, Mosia hnêna Pathian pêk kha, Hilkia chuan a chhar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Safana hnênah, “Hei Tempul chhûngah, Dân bu ka chhar e,” a ti a, a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Safana chuan lal hnênah a kalpui a, “I sawi ang zawng zawng chu kan ti zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tempula kawl ṭhat tangka chu kan la a, hnathawktute leh a enkawltute hlawhah kan pe tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hei Hilkia mi pêk, lehkhabu ka rawn keng e,” a ti a. Lal hriat tûr chuan a chhiar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalin Dân thu an chhiar a han ngaihthlâk chuan a puan a pawtthlêr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hilkia te, Safana fapa Ahikama te, Mika fapa Abdona te, lehkha ziaktu Safana te, lal enkawltu Asaia te chu a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“He Dân bu chungchâng thu-ah hian ka tân te, Israel leh Judai rama la dam chhun tân te Lalpa chu min va râwnsak teh u, min thlahtute chuan Lalpa thu an zâwm duh lo va, he lehkhabua tih tûr sawite chu an tih duh loh avângin kan chungah Lalpa a thinur a ni,” tiin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hilkia leh lal mi tirh dangte chu Tokhata fapa Saluma nupui zâwlnei Huldaii hnênah chuan an kal a, Tokhata hi Hasra fapa a ni, Saluma hi Tempula puithiam thawmhnaw enkawltu Jerusalem vêng thara awm a ni a, thil awm dân chu Huldaii an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti. Ka hnêna nangmahni rawn tîrtu chu hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, ‘Lal hriata an chhiar chhuah lehkhabu ziala ânchhia zawng zawng kha Jerusalem leh a chhûnga chêngte chungah ka tlâktîr dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Min hnâwl a, pathian dang hnênah thilhlante an hlân a, an thiltih chuan min tithinur ta a ni. Jerusalem chungah ka thin a ur êm êm a, a dai mai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal chungchâng erawh chu, kei, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian hian heti hian ka ti a ni: Lehkhabu thu ziak chu i ngaithla a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />i sim a, i inphahhniam ta a. Jerusalem leh a chhûnga mi ka hrem dâwn ka tih khân pawi tiin i puan i pawtthlêr a, i ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jerusalem chu i thih hnuah chauh a ni ka hrem dâwn ni, thlamuang takin ka thihtîr ang che a, he hmun leh a chhûnga awmte chunga ka rawn thlentîr tûr thil ṭha lo zawng zawngte chu i hmu lo vang,’ a ti,” a lo ti a. Chu thu keng chuan mite chu lal hnênah an lo kîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal Josia chuan Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a upate chu a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Puithiamte leh Levia chite nên Tempulah an kal a, mi rethei leh mi hausate pawhin an zui a. Lal chuan Tempul chhûnga Thuthlung bu an chhar chu mipui hmaah chuan a chhiar chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lal dinna tûra ruat ban bulah chuan a ding a, LALPA hnênah thu a thlung a, a thu awiha, rilru taka tihtakzetin a dânte leh a thupêkte chu zawm a tiam a, lehkhabua thu chuang zawng zawng pawisak vek a tiam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamin-ho leh Jerusalem-a awm tawh phawt chu thuthlung zâwm tûrin thu a tiamtîr a. An pute Pathian nêna thuthlung lo siam tawha tih tûr awmte chu Jerusalem mite chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lal Josia chuan Israel mite ram chhûnga milem tenawm tak tak chu a tichhe vek a, a dam chhûng chuan mite chu an thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa rawng a bâwltîr a. Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian an zui chu a pênsan lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Josia chuan Lalpa hmingin Jerusalem-ah Kalhlên kût a hmang a. Thla khatna, ni sâwm leh pali ni chuan kûtna tûr ran a talh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiamho chu Tempula an thawh tûr hna a sem a, ṭha taka thawk tûrin a fuih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa tâna serh hran, Dân zirtîrtu Levia chite pawh hetiang hian a hrilh a: “Davida fapa Solomona in sak chhûngah Thuthlung Bâwm hi dah rawh u, zâwn sawn chhên a ngai tawh lo. In Pathian, Lalpa leh a mi Israel-te rawng in bâwl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A chi chi-in Tempula in awmna tûrah awm ula, in tih tûr lal Davida leh a fapa Solomonan an ruat ang kha ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hna in insem hunah Israel chhûngkawho ṭanpuitu tûr Levia mite ruat ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kalhlên Kût sa tûr berâm leh kêl in talh tûr a ni. Tûnah inthian thianghlim rawh u, an thilhlan tûrte hlanpui ula, Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang kha in unau Israel-te chuan an zawm theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kalhlên Kûta mipui hman atân Josia chuan ama ran rual zînga mi ngei berâm te, berâmno te leh keltê sîngthum, bâwngpa sângthum a thawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A miliante pawh chuan mipui te, puithiam te leh Levia chi te ei tûr an thawh bawk a. Tempul hotu puithiam lalber Hilkia te, Zekaria te leh Jehiela te chuan berâmno leh keltê sanghnih leh zaruk leh bâwngpa zathum, kût chhûnga thilhlana an hlan tûrin puithiamte chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levia chi hotu Konania te, Semaia te leh a unau Nethanela te, Hasabia te, Jeiela te, Jozabada te chuan berâmno leh keltê sângnga leh bâwngpa zanga, Levia chiten thilhlana an hman tûr an thawh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kalhlên Kût hmanna tûr engkim an tihfel hnu chuan lal thu angin puithiamte leh Levia chite chu an hmun ṭheuh tûrah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kêl leh berâm an talh zawh chuan Levia chite chuan a vun an lip a, puithiamten a thisen chu maichâmah an theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlana hman tûr chu chhûng tin tân Mosia Dân bu-a ziak anga an hlan tûrin an sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levia chite chuan Dân angin Kalhlên kût sa chu an hem hmin a, sa thianghlim ṭhenkhat chu bêlah te, thîrbêlah te, bêlpuiah te an chhûm a, a sa chu mipui an sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan anmahni leh Arona thlah puithiamte ei tûr sa an siam leh a, puithiamho khân hâlral thilhlan leh an thilhlan thau hâlna mei chu an vil zânkhua si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal Davida thupêk angin Asafa te, Hemana te leh lal zâwlnei Jeduthuna te chuan thil tum mi Asafa thlahte chu an awmna hmun tûrah an awmtîr a. Tempul vêngtute tân pawh kal sawn a ngai lo, an ṭhian Levia chi, mi dangte khân Kalhlên Kût sa chu an lo buatsaihsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal Josia thu ang chuan Lalpa chu an bia a, tih tûr zawng zawng, Kalhlên Kût hman te, maichâma hâlral thilhlan hlan te chu an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng, Kalhlên Kût leh chhang dawidim telh loh kût chu Israel mi zawng zawngin an hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zâwlnei Samuela thih hnu kha chuan heti taka ropui hian Kalhlên Kût an hmang ngai lo. Lal Josia te, puithiam te, Levia chi te, Juda leh Israel rama awmte leh Jerusalem-a awmten Kalhlên Kût an hman ang hian an la hmang ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Josia kum sâwm leh pariat a lal kum khân an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal Josian heti taka Tempul a chei hnu hian Aigupta lal Nekoa chuan Eufretis lui kamah, Karkhemis-ah, indo tûrin a sipaite a hruai a. Josia chuan lo dan a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nekoa chuan, “Nang Juda lal, he thilah hian i lo inrawlhna tûr a awm lo. Nang bei tûr chein ka lo kal lo, ka hmêlma bei tûra lo kal ka ni. Pathian chuan hmanhmawh tûrin min ti a ni, ka lamṭang a ni a, mi lo dan tum teh suh, a tichhe palh ang che,” tiin palai a rawn tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josia chuan lo beih chu a tum ta tlat a, Nekoa hmanga Pathian thu sawi chu a awih duh lo va, a inchei danglam a, Megido phaia an inbeihnaah chuan a kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An inbeih lai chuan Aigupta sipai thal chuan Josia chu a fuh ta a. A tawlailîr khalhtu hnênah, “Min hliam na hle mai, indona hmun ata hi min chhuahpui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama tawlailîr ata chu an zâwn chhuak a, tawlailîr dang a hruaiah chuan an dah a; Jerusalem-ah an hâwn ta a. A thi a, lal thlânah an phûm a, Judai ram leh Jerusalem mite chuan an ui a, an sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zâwlnei Jeremia chuan Josia sûnna hla a phuah a, Israel zîngah chuan hla sa mi, mipa leh hmeichhiaten lal sûn hlaah an sa ṭhîn. Sûnna hla ziak khâwmna bu-ah chu hla chu a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josia thil tih zawng zawng, Lalpa a ngainatzia te, Dân thu a awihzia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a bul aṭanga a tâwp thleng chanchin chu Israel leh Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai ram mite chuan Josia fapa Jehoahaza chu lalah an thlang a, Jerusalem-ah hriak an thih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoahaza chu kum sawmhnih leh pathum a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a, thla thum a lal hman a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta lal Nekoa chuan salah a man a, Judai ram chu, chhiah, tangkarua kg. sângthum leh zali leh rangkachak kg. sawmthum leh pali a chawitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nekoa chuan Jehoahaza u Eliakima chu Judai ram lalah a dah a, a hmingah Jehoiakima a sak tharsak a, Jehoahaza chu Aigupta ramah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakima chu kum sawmhnih leh panga a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a. Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh pakhat a lal a. Lalpa , a Pathian mit hmuhah thil sual a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chuan Judai ram a rûn a, Jehoiakima chu a man a, khaidiata phuar chungin Babulon-ah a hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nebukadnezara chuan Tempula thil hlu ṭhenkhat chu a hâwn bawk a, Babulon khuaa a inah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakima thil tih zawng zawng, thil tenawm tak tak a tih te leh thil sual a tihte chu Israel leh Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang vek a ni; a aiah a fapa Jehoiakina chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakina chu kum sâwm leh pariat a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah thla thum leh ni sâwm a lal hman a. Ani pawh Lalpa lakah thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nipui a thâwk dâwn lai vêl chuan lal Nebukadnezara a lo kal a, Babulon-ah salah a hruai a; Tempula thil hlu zawng zawng pawh a hâwn vek a. Nebukadnezara chuan Jehoiakina nau Zedekia chu Judai ram leh Jerusalem lalah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekia chu kum sâwm leh pariat a nihin Judai ramah a lal a. Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh pakhat chhûng a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa lakah thil sual a ti a; Lalpa thu thlentu zâwlnei Jeremia thu lah ngaihthlâk thamah a ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zedekia chu Nebukadnezara lakah a hel ta mai a. Pathian hminga thu a tiamtîr, lalah a dah a ni si a. Luhlul a chhuah a, a sim duh lo va, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa lam a hawi duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda upa te, puithiam te leh mipui te lah chuan an vêla hnam sualho tih dân an la a, Lalpa tihthianghlim tawh Tempul chu milem biain an tibawrhbâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa an thlahtute Pathian chuan Tempul leh a mite chu chhan a duh avângin mipui zilh tûrin zâwlneite a tîr fo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mahse, Pathian tirhte chu an lo deusawh a, an thute lah engah mah an ngai hek lo. Zâwlneite chu an nuihzatbûr a, a tâwp a tâwpah chuan Lalpa chu pumpelh rual lohvin a thinur ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan anmahni sawisa tûrin Babulon lal chu a rawn tîr a, lal chuan Judai ram tlangvâlte chu Tempul chhûngah meuh pawh a that ta zêl a. Naupang te, tar te, a hmei a pa, hrisêl leh hrisêl lo pawh tu mah lainat a nei lo. Pathianin a kutah a pe vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babulon lal chuan Tempul chu a rawk a, thil hlu dah khâwmte chu a la a, lal in leh milian ina thil awm zawng zawng chu Babulon-ah a hâwn vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tempul leh khuaa inte chu a hâl a, khawpui kulh bangte chu a ṭhiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thi bâng zawng zawng chu Babulon-ah a hruai haw a, Persia-ho an lo len thleng khân amah leh a hote bawihah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jeremia kâa Lalpa thu sawi lâwk, ‘kum sawmsarih chhûng in ram chu a châwl dêr dâwn a ni,’ a tih kha a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Persia rama lal Kura a lal ṭan tirh kumin, Lalpa chuan Jeremia kâa a thu sawi kha a rawn tipuitling ta a. Lal Kura chu a thunun a, hetiang hian thu a pêktîr a, a ram chhûng hmun tina chhiar theih tûrin ziakin thu chu a thawn chhuak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Hei hi Persia lal Kura thupêk a ni. Lalpa , vân Pathian chuan khawvêl puma rorêltuah mi siam a. Judai ram Jerusalem-ah a tân Tempul sa tûrin min ti bawk a ni. Chuvângin, Pathian mite u, in za-in tah chuan kal rawh u, in Pathian, Lalpa chuan awmpui che u rawh se,” tiin.
  </para>
</usx>
